<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">MAL 42.Soli Bible version</book>
  <para style="h">MALIKO</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mulumbe Waina wa Yesu Klistu walalembwa ne Maliko</para>
  <para style="toc2">Maliko</para>
  <para style="toc3">Maliko</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mulumbe Waina wa Yesu Klistu walalembwa ne</para>
  <para style="mt1">Maliko</para>
  <para style="imt">Busansulushi</para>
  <para style="ip">Mulumbe Waina walalembwa ne Maliko ni libuku limo pa mabuku ana a Mulumbe Waina a mucipangno ca linolino ayo alambangasha buyumi bwa Yesu Klistu.Alalembwa panyuma pa lufu lwa Yesu Klistu ne Mateyu,Maliko,Luka kayi ne Yohane.Mulumbe Waina walalembwa ne Maliko eufupi pa mabuku ana a Mulumbe Waina.Cikute kuboneketi e libuku lya kutanguna kulembwa pa mabuku aya ana a Mulumbe Waina mu myaka yakwana makumi asanu ne cimo kushika ku makumi asanu ne abili panyuma pa kusemwa kwa Klistu.Bantu bangi bayiya bashometi lyalalembelwa ku Loma,kwambeti ayuminishe Baklistu ba ku Loma.</para>
  <para style="ip">Maliko uyu weshibikweti Yohane Maliko walendapo pamo ne Mutumwa Paulo ne Banabasi,nsombi impuwo yakendi yalayanda konongeka pacindi ncalabashiya bonka pa bulwendo (Incito 13:13). Kumasuba akuntangu walendapo pamo ne Banabasi (Incito 15:37-39). Maliko walikuba munendi Petulo kwine (1 Pet. 5:13). Nekukabeti Maliko nkalikubapo kamboni wancinencine pa buyumi bwa Yesu; Nomba bantu bangi bayiya bashometi Maliko ewalikulemba bukamboni bwa Petulo buli mulibuku lya Mulumbe Waina walalembwa ne Maliko.Mulumbe Waina uwu,walanga pabeshikwiya ne ciyisho ca Yesu ne cindi ca mapwililisho.</para>
  <para style="iot">Mitwi ya makani</para>
  <para style="io1">Maliko latatikinga libuku ili (1:1-13).</para>
  <para style="io1">Kufumapo lasansululunga incito ya Yesu kacili mucimpansha ca Galileya (1:14 mpaka 8:21).</para>
  <para style="io1">Cakonkapo lambanga shabulwendo bwa Yesu ku Yelusalemu (8:22 mpaka 10:52).</para>
  <para style="io1">Maliko lapwishinga kulemba sha Yesu pacindi ncalikuba ku Yelusalemu, ne sha lufu lwa Yesu ne kupunduka kwakendi (11:1 mpaka 16:8).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kukambauka kwa Yohane Mubatishi.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mateyo 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luka 3:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yohane 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ici ecitatiko ca Mulumbe Waina ulambanga sha Yesu Klistu, Mwanendi Lesa. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Walatatika mbuli ncewalalembwa mulibuku lya Yesaya mushinshimi, Lesa walambeti,</para>
  <para style="q">“Ninkatume mutumwa wakame</para>
  <para style="q">pantangu pakobe, uyo eti akabambe nshila yakobe,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Pali liswi lya muntu labilikishinga mu cinyika limbangeti,</para>
  <para style="q">Bambani mukwakwa mwakupita Mwami,</para>
  <para style="q">Lulamikani nshila njoti akapitemo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Neco, Yohane walashika mucinyika kakambauka nekubatisha bantu. Walambila bantu eti, “Shiyani bwipishi mubatishiwe, kayi Lesa namulekelele bwipishi bwenu.” <verse number="5" style="v"/>Neco, bantu bangi bekala mu cimpansha ca Yudeya ne mu Yelusalemu balaya kuli Yohane akunyumfwa. Abo balikulyambilila bwipishi bwabo walababatisha mu mulonga wa Yolodano.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yohane walikufwala mwinjila wa bweya bwa ngamila, kayi ne lamba wa cipaya mubukome. Byakulya byakendi byalikuba bikobo ne bwiki bwamucisuwa. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Walikukambauketi, “Panyuma pakame, palesanga ukute ngofu kupita shakame. Ame nkandelela kukotameti nsungulule ntambo sha nkwabilo shakendi. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Ame ndamubatishanga ne menshi, nsombi nendi nakamubatishenga ne Mushimu Uswepa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kubatishiwa ne kusunkwa kwa Yesu.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-4:11">Mateyo 3:13—4:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luka 3:21-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">4:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Paliya kupita masuba angi, Yesu walafuma ku Nasaleti mucimpansha ca Galileya. Walabatishiwa ne Yohane mu mulonga wa Yolodano. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Mpwalikufuma mu menshi, walabona kwilu kwalacaluka, kayi Mushimu Uswepa waleseti nkulimba nekwikala palyendiye. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Popelapo palanyumfwika liswi kwilu lyakwambeti,</para>
  <para style="q">“Obe njobe Mwaname</para>
  <para style="q">ngondayandishisha,</para>
  <para style="q">ndakondwa muli njobe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Popelapo Mushimu Uswepa walapesheti enga mucinyika. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Walekalako masuba makumi ana, kasunkwa ne Satana. Walikuba pakati pa banyama, nsombi bangelo balikumunyamfwilisha.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Lakunga basulishi bana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-22">Mateyo 4:12-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luka 4:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">5:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Pacindi Yohane mpwalabikwa mujele, panyuma pakendi Yesu walaya ku Galileya kuya kukambauka Mulumbe Waina wa Lesa. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Walikwambeti, “Cindi cilashiki, Bwami bwa Lesa bulaseng'ene pepi! Kamulapani, kayi kamushomani Mulumbe Waina.” <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nomba pacindi ncalikwenda mu mbali mwa lwenje lwa Galileya, walabona Shimoni ne Ndileya pabukwabo, kabawala tombe mulwenje, pakwinga balikuba basulishi banswi.<figure style="fig" desc="" file="07 Fishing.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="1:16">Muntu lekatanga Inswi ne kombe</figure> <verse number="17" style="v"/>Neco Yesu walabambileti, “Kamunkonkani, ninkamwiyishe kuba basulishi ba bantu.” <verse number="18" style="v"/>Popelapo balashiya tombe twabo ne kumukonkela.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kayi mpwalendako pang'ana, walabona Jemusi ne Yohane banabendi Sebedayo, mu bwato kababamba tombe twabo. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Naboyo pacindi copeleco Yesu walabakuwa. Balashiya mushali wabo Sebedayo mubwato pamo ne basebenshi, balo balaya pamo ne Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Muntu wekatwa ne mushimu waipa.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:31-37">Luka 4:31-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu pamo ne beshikwiya bakendi balaya ku Kapelenao, mpobwalashika busuba bwa Sabata bwakupumwina, Yesu walengila mung'anda yakupaililamo ne kutatika kwiyisha. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Nomba bantu balamunyumfwa ncalikwiyisha balakankamana, pakwinga nkalikwiyisheti beshikwiyisha ba milawo ya Mose, nsombi nendi walikwiyisha ne ngofu sha bwendeleshi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Pacindi copeleco muntu wekatwa ne mushimu waipa, neye walesa mu ng'anda yakupaililamo, muntuyo walabilikisheti, <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Tukute mulandu cini kuli njamwe Yesu wa ku Nasaleti? Sena waleshila kutushina? Ame ndimwinshi, njamwe Waswepa wa Lesa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Nomba Yesu walaucancilila mushimu waipa ne kuwambileti “Komwena, pula mu muntuyu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Panyuma pa kumuwishila panshi kanyukuma, mushimu waipa walabilikisha cangofu, ne kufumamo popelapo. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Bantu bonse balakankamana ne kutatika kwipushana pa lwabo bene, “Inga ici nicani? Cakubinga ni ciyisho censu cangofu! Ha, lacancililinga ne mishimu yaipa yonse mwangofu, nayo ilamunyumfwilinga!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Neco, impuwo yakendi lwalamwaikila bwangu mu misena yonse ya mu cimpansha ca Galileya.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lasengulunga bantu bangi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mateyo 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luka 4:38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu pamo ne beshikwiya bakendi pamo ne Jemusi ne Yohane, mpobalapula mung'anda yakupaililamo, balaya kung'anda ya Shimoni ne Ndileya. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Kumakwendi Shimoni batukashi balikuba bona kabanyumfwa mubili kulungula,Yesu mpwalashika mwakufwambana balamwinshibisha. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yesu walaya mpobalikuba bona walabekata kucikasa ne kubapundusha. Popelapo bulwashi bwalapwa, balatatika kubabambila cakulya. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Mansailo, lisuba mpolyalebila, bantu balatatika kumuletela Yesu balwashi bonse, ne abo bekatwa ne mishimu yaipa. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Bantu bonse bamu munshi balabungana pa lubansa. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu walabasengula balikukolwa malwashi apusana pusana, walapulisha mishimu yaipa, kayi nkali kwisuminisha kwambapo, pakwinga yaliku mwinshiba.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lakambaukunga mu Galileya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:42-44">Luka 4:42-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Kumaca kapacili pashipuluka, Yesu walapunduka mung'anda ne kuya kumusena kwabula bantu nkwalaya kupaila. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Nomba Shimoni ne banendi balatatika kumulangaula. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Mpobalamucana balambeti “Bantu bonse balamulangaulunga.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Nomba Yesu walabakumbuleti, “Katuyani kumbi ku minshi ili pepi, kwambeti enkambaukeko, pakwinga encondaleshila.” <verse number="39" style="v"/>Kayi walaya mu manda abo akupaililamo mu Galileya monse, kaya kukambauka ne kupulisha mishimu yaipa.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lasengulunga shimankuntu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mateyo 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luka 5:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Shimankuntu walesa kuli Yesu ne kumusuntamina ne kumusengeti, “Nakamuyanda, inga munswepesha.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Yesu walepilwa moyo neco, walatandabula cikasa cakendi ne kumwikata ne kumwambileti, “Ee ndayandishishinga, swepesha.” <verse number="42" style="v"/>Pacindi copeleco, mankuntu alashimangana, walaswepa. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Nomba Yesu walamwambileti enga kwabo, ne kumucenjesheti, <verse number="44" style="v"/>“Konyumfwa, kotaya wambile muntu naba umo sobwe, nsombi uye uliboneshe kuli Shimilumbo, ne kubenga milumbo ilayandikinga mu milawo ya Mose pacebo ca kuswepeshewa kwakobe kwambeti kube bukamboni kubantu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Nomba mpwalafumapo, nendi walatatika kwambila uliyense ne kumwaya makani mumisena ingi, neco Yesu calamwalila kwingila mu minshi mwakubonekela. Nsombi walapitilisha kwikala enka ku musena kwabula bantu. Nikukabeco bantu balikabesa nkwalikuba kufuma mu mbasu shapusana pusana.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu lasengulunga muntu watontola biso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mateyo 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:15-26">Luka 5:15-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Mpopalapitako masuba, Yesu walabwela ku Kapelenawo, bantu balanyumfweti uli pang'anda mpwalikwikala. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Neco bantu bangi balabungana pang'anda cakwinseti mwalalabula musena mung'anda nambi palubansa, pakwinga bantu balafulisha mpaka pacishinga. nsombi nendi walatatika kukambauka sha maswi a Lesa. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kwalashika bantu bana balikuba batatula muntu mulema ne kumuleta kuli Yesu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nomba baliya kushika nendi pepi ne Yesu, pakwinga kwalikuba bantu bangi. Neco balashimbulula pelu paciluli kwelana ne mpalikuba Yesu. mpobalashimbulula balamwingisha mulwashi usa kali wona pa mpasa. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nomba Yesu mpwalabona lushomo lwabo walambila muntu mulema usa eti, “O mwaname, bwipishi bwakobe bulalekelelwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Lino beshikwiyisha milawo nabambi balikubapo balatatika kuyeyaula mu myoyo yabo eti, <verse number="7" style="v"/>“Nicani cilamwambinshinga cisa muntuyu? Lanyanshanga Lesa! Niyani welela kulekelela bwipishi? Sena nte Lesa enka?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Pacindi copeleco Yesu walenshiba mu moyo mwakendi kwambeti encobalayeyenga, neco walabepusheti, “Inga mulayeyelenga cani bintu ibi mu myoyo yenu? <verse number="9" style="v"/>Sena capubako cipeyo, kwambila muntu mulema eti, ‘Bwipishi bwakobe bulalekelelwa’ Nambi kwambeti, ‘Nyamuka manta mpasa yakobe wende.’ <verse number="10" style="v"/>Neco, nindimuleshe kwambeti, Mwana Muntu nkute ngofu shakulekelela bwipishi pacishi capanshi.” Neco walambila muntu mulema usa, <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Ndakwambalinga, nyamuka! Manta, mpasa yakobe koya kwenu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Popelapo walapunduka ne kumanta mpasa yakendi, ne kutatika kulyendela enka pa menso pa cinyabwingi. Ici calankakamanisha bonse, neco, balamushikaisha Lesa ne kwambeti, “Bilicisa nkatunatubibonapo sobwe!”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Lakunga Levi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mateyo 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luka 5:27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kayi Yesu walendana mumbali mwa lwenje, bantu bangi balesa kulyendiye. nendi walatatika kubeyisha. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Mpwalendanako walabona Levi mwanendi Alufeyo, kali wekala mu kanda kakusonkelamo musonko. Yesu walamwambileti, “Nkonkele.” Popelapo walanyamuka ne kumukonkela.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Pacindi nacimbi Yesu mpwalikulya mung'anda ya Levi pamo ne beshikwiya bakendi, beshimisonko ne beshimicito yaipa balikulya pamo, pakwinga<note caller="+" style="f"/> bantu bangi balikumukonkela. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Beshikwiyisha bamilawo ya Mose nabambi bamulikoto lyaba Falisi mpobalaboneti lalinga pamo ne bantu ba micito yaipa ne beshimisonko Balepusha beshikwiya ba Yesu eti, “Lalingeconi pamo ne beshimisonko ne beshimicito yaipa?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalanyumfwa, walabakumbuleti, “Bantu balabulunga kukolwa nkabakute kuyanda mung'anga sobwe, nsombi nibalwashi. Ndiya kwisakukuwa balulama sobwe, nsombi bamicito yaipa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kulikanisha Kulya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mateyo 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luka 5:33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Beshikwiya ba Yohane Mubatishi kayi ne beshikwiya ba Bafalisi balo bakute kulikanisha kulya. Popelapo bantu nabambi balamwipusha Yesu, “Inga nipacebo cini beshikwiya ba Yohane kayi ne beshikwiya ba Bafalisi ncebakute kulikanisha kulya nomba benu nkabakute kulikanisha?” <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yesu walabakumbuleti, “Sena shibwinga acibanga pamo ne mbwalatamba kubwinga ngabalikanisha kulya? Nkabela kulikanisha kulya sobwe. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nomba nicikashike cindi ncotibakamufulepo shibwinga, pacindico nibakatatike kulikanisha kulya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Paliya muntu ukute kutunga cimami ca linolino pa mwinjila wakaindi, pakwinga ayinseco cimami ico inga cikokonyana nekumatula mwinjila wakaindi, ne kushiya cibwanko cinene pa mwinjila wakaindi usa. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Paliya ukute kubika waini wamutumba mu cifwafumwa cacipaya cakaindi, pakwinga ayinseco, waini uwo ngaupasula cifwafumwa, kayi waini ne cifwafumwa byonse ngabitaika. Caina nikubika waini wamutumba mu cifwafumwa ca cipaya calinolino.</para>
  <para style="s">Sabata busuba bwakupumwina Bayuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mateyo 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luka 6:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Pa Sabata busuba bwakupumwina bwa Bayuda, Yesu pamo ne beshikwiya bakendi balikupita pakati pa mabala a mayila, kabaya kuningula ngala shamaila. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Bafalisi balamwipusha Yesu, “Inga, nicani beshikwiya bakobe n-cobalenshilinga bintu byabula kusumishiwa kwinsa pa busuba bwa kupumwina?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Nendi Yesu walabakumbuleti, “Sena muliya kubelengapo ncalensa Defeti pamo ne batuloba mbwalikuba nabo mpwobalanyumfwa nsala, nomba kabali babula cakulya <verse number="26" style="v"/>Nte usa walengila mu Ng'anda ya Lesa, pacindi Abiyatala mpwalikuba Mukulene wa Beshimilumbo, walalya shinkwa watondwa walikubengwa kuli Lesa. Balikuba basuminishiwa kulya ni beshimilumbowa bonka, nomba Dafeti walalya nekupako batuloba mbwalikuba nabo?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yesu walabambileti, “Sabata yalabikwapo pacebo ca muntu, muntu uliyakubikwako pacebo ca Sabata sobwe <verse number="28" style="v"/>Ekwambeti Mwana Muntu ni Mwami wa bintu byonse, kayi wabusuba bwa Sabata.”</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Muntu wakokonyana cikasa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mateyo 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luka 6:6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Pacindi nacimbi Yesu walengila mung'anda yakupaililamo, mopelomo mwalikuba muntu wakokonyana cikasa. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Bantu bambi balikubamo balasha menso pali Yesu kwambeti babone mpani ingaumusengula usa muntu pa busuba bwa Sabata, kwambeti bamucaninepo mulandu wa kumubepeshela. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nomba Yesu walamwambila muntu wakokonyana cikasa eti, “Nyamuka, kwesa wimanine pantangu.” <verse number="4" style="v"/>Lino Yesu walabepusheti, “Inga nicipeyo casuminishiwa ne mulawo kwinsa pabusuba bwa Sabata? Kwinsa caina nambi caipa? Kupulusha buyumi bwa muntu nambi kononga?”</para>
  <para style="p">Nomba nabo balamwena tonto. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nomba Yesu walalanga uku ne uku mwabukalu, ne kwetelwa mumoyo pa cebo cakuyuma myoyo kwabo. Neco walamwambila muntuyo eti, “Tandabula cikasa cakobe.” Nendi walatandabula cikasa, neco calaba cena. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Popelapo Bafalisi balapula mung'anda yakupaililamo balaya kukumana ne bantu ba mulikoto lya Helode, kwambeti bacane nshila yakushininamo Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Likoto lyabantu ku lwenje lwa Galileya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yesu ne beshikwiya bakendi balafumako ne kuya ku lwenje lwa Galileya, nomba likoto lya bantu lyalamukonka, beshikufuma ku Galileya ne ku Yudeya, <verse number="8" style="v"/>ne ku Yelusalemu ne ku Idumeya kayi ne kutala kwa Yolodani ne mu bibela bya Tulo ne Sidoni. Bonse balanyumfwa mbyalikwinsa balabungana nkwalikuba. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Bantu balikuba bangi kwine, neco Yesu walambila beshikwiya bakendi kwambeti bamuleteleko bwato atantemo, kukineti bantu kabatamushankanya. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Pakwinga walikali lasengulupo bantu bangi, bonse balikuba bekatwa ne mishimu yaipa, kayi ne malwashi apensha balikabanyakana kwambeti bamukumyeko. <verse number="11" style="v"/>cindi conse mishimu yaipa, yamubona Yesu yalikupesheti bantu bekatwa mishimu iyo bawe panshi pamyendo yakendi. Mishimu yaipa yalikubilikisheti, “Amwe njamwe Mwanendi Lesa!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nomba Yesu walikuyambilishisha mishimu isa kwambeti kaitamuyubululanga.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lasalanga batumwa likumi ne babili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mateyo 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luka 6:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesu walatanta pa mulundu ne kukuwako bonka balikuyandika, naboyo balaya nkwalikuba. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Walasalapo bantu likumi ne babili mbwalakuweti, “batumwa” Ne kubambileti “Ndamusala kwambeti mwikalenga ne njame, ndimutumenga kuya kukambauka. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Kayi ndamupanga ngofu shakupulisha mishimu yaipa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Batumwa likumi ne babili mbwalasala balikuba aba Shimoni ngwalatumbiketi Petulo, <verse number="17" style="v"/>ne Jemusi ne Yohane banabendi Sebedayo, Aba babili Yesu walabapa lina lya Bowanege, lilapandululungeti Bana ba kukunkuma, <verse number="18" style="v"/>ne Ndileya ne Filipo ne Batolomeya ne Mateyo ne Tomasi ne Jemusi mwanendi Alufeyo ne Tadeyo ne Shimoni wa mucipani ca bantu balikulwanina lwanguluko mu cishi ca Islayeli, <verse number="19" style="v"/>kayi ne Yuda Isikalyoti uyo walayaba Yesu kubalwani.</para>
  <para style="s">Bantu balamwelanikinga Yesu ne Belezebulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-32">Mateyo 12:22-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luka 11:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:10">12:10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesu walabwela kung'anda nkwalikushikila, likoto lya bantu lyalabungana kayi kopeloko, cakwambeti Yesu ne beshikwiya balabula ne cindi cakulya. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Nomba bakwabo mpobalanyumfweco, balikuyanda kuya kumufunyako, pakwinga bantu balikwambeti, “Yesu lakonyo!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Nomba beshikwiyisha milawo ya Mose balafumina ku Yelusalemu balikwambeti, “Wekatwa ne Belesebulu, mwami wamishimu yaipa, endiye lamupanga ngofu sha kupulisha mishimu yaipa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Kayi Yesu walabakuwa, ne kutatika kubapa mikoshanyo ne kwambeti, “Inga Satana ngaucikonsheconi kupulisha Satana? <verse number="24" style="v"/>Na bwami bupansana bwine, bwami ubo nkabwela kwikalisha sobwe, <verse number="25" style="v"/>Na bantu ba mukowa umo batatika kubukilana palwabo, mukowa uyo nkawelela kwikalisha sobwe. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Ni cimo cimo, na bwendeleshi bwa Satana bulibukila bwine ne kupansana, bwendeleshi ubo nkabwela kwikalisha sobwe, nsombi bulenga kumapwililisho.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Paliya muntu welela kwingila mung'anda ya muntu wangofu ne kumantamo bibya byakendi, kwakubula nanshi kumusunga muntu wangofu. Ayinseco mpwelela kumantamo bibya mung'anda.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Cakubinga ndamwambilinga, bantu nibakalekelelwe bwipishi ne byonse byaipa mbyebalambanga. <verse number="29" style="v"/>nomba uliyense lanyanshanga Mushimu Uswepa nteti akalekelelwe sobwe. Nendi nakabe ne mulandu wa bwipishi butapu.” <verse number="30" style="v"/>(Yesu walambeco pakwinga bantu bambi balikumwambeti, ukute mushimu waipa.)</para>
  <para style="s">Banyina ne bamakwabo Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mateyo 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luka 8:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Lino banyina ne bamakwabo Yesu balashika, ne kwimana pansa ne kumutumina muntu kuya kumukuwa. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Bantu bangi balikuba bamushinguluka Yesu, balamwambileti, “Banyoko ne ba kwenu bali pansa balakuyandanga.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Yesu pakubakumbula walambeti, “Bama ne bamakwetu nibani?” <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu pakubalangishisha pabantu balikuba bekala panshi kabali bamushinguluka, walambeti, “Bonani, aba ebama kayi ebamakwetu.” <verse number="35" style="v"/>“Uliyense lenshinga kuyanda kwa Lesa, uyo emukwetu mutuloba nambi mutukashi kayi ebama.”</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Mukoshano wa Shikubyala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mateyo 13:1-9</ref>; Luka 8:4-8 )</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Kayi Yesu walatatika kwiyisha mumbali mwa lwenje. Likoto linene lya bantu lyalabungana nkwalikuba, cakwinseti walatanta mubwato mwalakekala capataliko, nalyo likoto lya bantu lyalekala kumunta mumbali mwa lwenje. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Walatatika kubeyisha bintu bingi mumikonshanyo. Walambeti, <verse number="3" style="v"/>“Kamunyumfwani! Muntu naumbi walaya kumwaya mbuto mulibala. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Mpwalikumwaya mbuto, nashimbi shalawila mumbali mwanshila, neco kwalesa bikeni byalashilya. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Mbuto nashimbi shalawila pa mabwe pabula bulongo bwingi. Shalamena bwangu, pakwinga nkapalikuba bulongo bwingi. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nomba lisuba mpolyatantako, mumena walanyana ne lumwi pakwinga nkashalikuba ne myanda yashimpa. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Mbuto nashimbi shalawila pa myunga, nomba myunga yalakula ne kufwekelela mumena, neco uliya kusema bisepo. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nomba nashimbi shalawila pabulongo bwabolela, shalamena ne kukula cena, shalatatika kusema bisepo, nashimbi makumi atatu, nashimbi makumi asanu ne limo, nashimbi shalasema mwanda umo kupita mbuto shalamwaiwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Pakupwililisha, Yesu walambeti, “Uyo ukute matwi anyumfwe!”</para>
  <para style="s">Ncalambila mikoshanyo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Mateyo 13:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luka 8:9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalekala enka, nabambi balikuba bekala pepi nendi pamo ne basa likumi ne babili balesa kumwipusha sha mikoshanyo isa. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nendi walabakumbuleti, “Amwe mulapewa casolekwa ca Bwami bwa Lesa, nomba kuli balikunsa byonse bilenshikinga mu mikoshanyo <verse number="12" style="v"/>kwambeti,</para>
  <para style="q">“kulanga kabalanga,</para>
  <para style="q">nsombi kabatalangishishi,</para>
  <para style="q">kunyumfwa kabayumfwa,</para>
  <para style="q">nomba kabatanyumfwishishi,</para>
  <para style="q">pakwinga na bensoco, ngabasanduka,</para>
  <para style="q">Nendi Lesa ngaubalekelela.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kupandulula mukoshanyo wa shikubyala mbuto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mateyo 13:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luka 8:11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesu walabepusheti, “Sena nkamuna munyumfwishisha mukoshanyo uwu? Inga lino nimukanyumfwishisheconi mikoshanyo naimbi? <verse number="14" style="v"/>Shikumwaya mbuto ulyeti shikukambauka maswi a Lesa. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Mbuto shalakawila mumbali munshila, shilemanininga bantu bakute kunyumfwa maswi a Lesa, nomba banyumfwa, cabwangubwangu Satana ukute kwisa kwafunyamo maswi amwaiwa mukati mwabo. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kayi mbuto shisa shalakawila pa mabwe, shilemanininga bantu bakute kunyumfwa maswi a Lesa ne kwatambula pa cindi copeleco mwakukondwa. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Nomba pakwinga maswi awo aliyawa miyanda, bakute kulikakatishako kacindi kafupi. Bacana mapesho ne bishikubaba pacebo ca maswi a Lesa, bakute kutyompwa bwangu. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nomba mbuto nashimbi shalakawila pa myunga, shilemanininga bantu bakute kunyumfwa maswi a Lesa, <verse number="19" style="v"/>nomba cebo cakufula kwa bishikutatisha pa buyumi bwabo pacindi cino, ne bwikalo bwalunkumbwa lwabuboni, ne bintu nabimbi, bikute kwingila ne kufwekelela maswi awa, neco nkakute kusema bisepo. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Imbuto isho shalakawila pa bulongo bwabolela, shilemanininga bantu bakute kunyumfwa maswi a Lesa ne kwatambula cena, ne kusema bisepo makumi atatu, nashimbi makumi asanu ne limo, nashimbi mwanda umo kupita isho shalabyalwa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mukoshanyo wa Lampi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 8:16-18">Luka 8:16-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Pacindi copeleco walabepusheti, “Nkabakute kufwekelela lampi mu mutanga, nambi kubika panshi pabulili, sena ncobakute kwinsa? Sena nkabakute kubika lampi pantangalala? <verse number="22" style="v"/>Paliya bintu byasolekwa, byeti bikabule kuyubululwa. Kayi paliya bintu byafwekwa byeti bikabule kufwekulwa. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Uyo ukute matwi anyumfwe!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yesu walambeti, “Shakoni mano kuli mbyomulanyumfunga. Mupimo ngomulapimininga banenu, munshila imo imo ne njamwe nibakamupimineko, cakubinga nibaka musankanishilepo. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Pakwinga uyo ukute bingi nakapewe bingi, nomba uyo ukuteko kang'ana, nambi kopelako nkalayeyengeti ukakute nibakamulamune.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mukoshanyo wambuto shishi kumena ne kukula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesu walambeti, “Bwami bwa Lesa buli mbuli muntu ukute kumwaila mbuto pa bulongo, <verse number="27" style="v"/>ukute kuya kona mashiku ne kupunduka bwaca, nasho mbuto shisa shamwaiwa shikute kumena ne kukula. Nomba moshikute kukulila, nkakute kwinshibapo sobwe. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Bulongo pacabo bwine bukute kumenesha, mukuya kwa cindi ngala shikute kuboneka, kayi mukuya kwa cindi kukute kupula tubeshi, kumapwililisho kwakendi, inseke shakoma shikute kubamo. <verse number="29" style="v"/>bisepo byakoma ukute kubiyangula ne Jekesi, pakwinga cindi ca kutebula cilakwana.”<figure style="fig" desc="" file="12 Sickle.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="4:29">Muntu layangulunga bishango ne jekesi</figure></para>
  <para style="s">Mukoshanyo wa mbuto ya masitadi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Mateyo 13:31-32</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 13:34">34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luka 13:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yesu walabepusheti, “Inga Bwami bwa Lesa tubwelanishe necani? Nambi tubwambe mumukoshanyo ulyeconi? <verse number="31" style="v"/>Bulyeti kambuto ka masitadi, ako pa cindi ca kukabyala kakute kakali kang'ana pa mbuto shonse shakubyala sha pacishi ca panshi. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Nomba kabyalwa kakute kumena ne kukula kupita mbuto shonse sha matewu shili mulibala, kakute kuba ne misampi inene, cakwinseti bikeni bikute kupangilamo bisangala mulumfwile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Yesu walikukambaukila bantu mulumbe mumikoshanyo ingi yamushobowu, mbuli mobelela kukonsha kunyumfwila. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Cakubinga uliya kwambapo nabo ciliconse kwakubula mukoshanyo, nsombi beshikwiya bakendi bonka embwali kubapandulwila byonse babanga pa lubasu bonka.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lalekeshenga Lukupwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mateyo 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luka 8:22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Pa busuba bopelobo mansailo, Yesu walambila beshikwiya bakendi eti, “Katutampukilako kutala kwa lwenje.” <verse number="36" style="v"/>Neco balashiya likoto lya bantu, ne kutanta nendi mubwato mbwalikubamo, kayi palikuba mato ambi. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Pacindici kwalesa lukumpwe lunene lwa ngofu, neco mankape alatatika kuma ku bwato, palashala pang'ana kwambeti bwato bwibile.<figure style="fig" desc="" file="09 Boat in Storm.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="4:37">Lukupwe lulomunga ku bwato</figure> <verse number="38" style="v"/>Nsombi Yesu walikuba mu bwato kunyuma, kaliwona tulo kali watamina pa mutamino. Beshikwiya bakendi balamunyukumuna ne kumwambileti, “Bashikwiyisha, nkamulashingonga mano, kwambeti tulipepi kufwa?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Walapashamuka ne kulucancilila lukupwe ne kulwambileti “Leka!” Kayi ne kwambila mankape, “Tontola!” Popelapo lukupwe lwalacileka, nawo mankape pa lwenje alamwena tonto. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Neco Yesu walabepusheti, “nicani ncemwabela ne buyowa bwa swaswalo? Sena mucili babula lushomo?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Nsombi nabo balanyumfwa buyowa ne kutatika kwamba kuli umo ne munendi eti, Inga uyu “Niyani cakwinseti lukupwe ne mankape pa lwenje byonse bilamunyumfwilanga!”</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu latandanyanga mishimu yaipa mu muntu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mateyo 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luka 8:26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu ne beshikwiya bakendi balatampukila kutala kwa lwenje lwa Galileya mu cishi ca Gelasa. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mpwalaseluka mubwato, walakumanya muntu wekatwa ne mishimu yaipa kafumina ku namaumbwe. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Walikwikala ku namaumbwe, paliya muntu naba umo walakonsha kumusunga ncetani. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Pakwinga walasungwapo ncetani kumakasa ne nshimbi kumyendo mankanda mangi, nsombi nendi walikusutaula ne kutyokola nshimbi. Paliya walikucikonsha kumukoma. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Cindi conse munshi ne mashiku, walikolobesha munamaumbwe ne mumalundu kaliyasaula ne mabwe. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nomba mpwalamubona Yesu capataliko, walamufwambila ne kumusuntamina, <verse number="7" style="v"/>Neco walolobesha ne kwamba maswi eshikunyumfwika capatali walambeti, “Nkute nenu cani Yesu Mwana Lesa wa Kwilu ku mayoba? Ndamusengenga mulina lya Lesa kwambeti kamutampesha.” <verse number="8" style="v"/>Walambeco pakwinga Yesu walawambila mushimuwo kwambeti, “Pula mu muntuyu mushimu waipa obe.” <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nomba Yesu walamwipusha muntuyu kwambeti, “Njobe bani lina?” Nendi walakumbuleti, <note caller="+" style="f"/>“Lina lyakame njame likoto, pakwinga tulimo bangi.” <verse number="10" style="v"/>Mishimu yaipa, yalapapata mankanda mangi kwambeti nkataituma kutali ne cibela ico.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Lino mungusa wa nkumba walikaulya pamulundu. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Neco, mishimu iyo yalamupapatileti, “kamututumani ku nkumba shisa, tuye twingilemo.” <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesu walesuminisha. Popelapo mishimu yaipa yalapulamo nekuya kwingila mu nkumba. Mungusa wonse walamfwambila cakumukolo lubilo ne kuya kuliwala mulwenje, ne kufwilamo shonse, pamo myanda makumi abili.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Balikushembela balafwambila ku minshi ne ku mabala, kabaya kwamba, neco bantu bangi balesa kubona bintu byalenshika. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Mpobalashika kuli Yesu, balabona muntu walikuba wekatwa ne mishimu yaipa kaliwekala, kaliwafwala, kaliwekalikana nkombe, ee muntu walikukute likoto lya mishimu yaipa, neco balaba ne buyowa. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Bantu abo balabonako ibyo byalenshika balabambila mocalabela ku muntu usa walikuba wekatwa mishimu yaipa, ne byalenshika ku nkumba.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Neco bantu abo balatatika kumusenga Yesu kwambeti afume mucishi cabo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Lino mpwali kutanta mubwato, muntu usa walikuba wekatwa mishimu yaipa walatatika kupapatila kwambeti benga pamo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Nsombi nkalamusuminisha sobwe, walamwambileti, “Koya ku munshi kubanse bobe wenga ubambile byonse Lesa mbyalakwinshili ne nkumbo nshalakuleshe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Neco walanyamuka ne kuya ku Minshi likumi kuya kwambila bantu bintu byonse mbyalamwinshila Yesu, bantu bonse balakankamana.</para>
  <para style="s">Mwanendi Yailo ne mutukashi walekata mwinjila wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mateyo 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luka 8:40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Pacindi Yesu mpwalatampukila kutala nakumbi mu bwato, likoto lya bantu bangi lyalabungana nkwalikuba, nsombi nendi walikuba mumbali mwa lwenje. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Popelapo umo wabatangunishi ba ng'anda ya kupaililamo lina lyakendi Yailo, walashika, mpwalamubona walamusuntamina, <verse number="23" style="v"/>ne kumupapatila mankanda angi, kwambeti, “Mwaname mutukashi lakolwa camakasa abili ndapapata katuyani mwenga mubike makasa enu palyendiye kwambeti bulwashi bumumbuluke abe cena.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Neco balanyamuka ne kuya pamo. Nomba likoto lya bantu lyalikumukonkela ne kumushankanya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Lino palikuba mutukashi walikukolwa bulwashi bwa mukunko kwa byaka likumi ne bibili. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Walapenga kwine, nikukabeti walaya ku bang'anga bangi. ne kononga mali akendi onse nsombi bulwashi bwa mukunko empo bwalikuya pantangu. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Mutukashi uyu mpwalanyumfwa bintu bingi mbyalikwinsa Yesu. Walakengila mulikoto lya bantu ne kwisa kwikata mwinjila wakunsa, cakunyuma kwa Yesu. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Pakwinga munkombe mwakendi wali kuyeyeti, “ndekatako mwinjila wakendi wakunsa ninsengulwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Pa cindi copeleco, bulwashi bwa mukunko bwalapwa, walanyumfwa mubili wakendi kwambeti lashilikwa kubulwashi bwamupenshanga. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yesu neye pacindi copeleco, walanyumfwa kwambeti ngofu nashimbi shakusengula shilapulumo, walacebuka mu likoto lya bantu ne kwipusheti, “Inga niyani lekatako ku mwinjila wakame?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Nomba beshikwiya bakendi balakumbuleti, “Bona bantu balakushankanyanga nibangi, nomba ulepushilingacani eti lakwikata niyani?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Nomba Yesu walikacebauka uku ne uku kwambeti abone lenshico. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Nomba mutukashi uyo walaba ne buyowa ne kutatika kututuma pa kwinshiba ncilamwinshinkili. Neco walesa pepi ne kusuntama pamenso pakendi ne kumwambila cancine ncine. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu walamwambila mutukashi uyo, “Omwana mutukashi obe lushomo lwakobe lulapesheti ube cena, Koya mu lumuno. Bulwashi bwakobe bwakumpenshanga bulapwilili.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Kacamba palashika batuloba balafumina kuli Yailo mutangunishi wa ng'anda ya kupaililamo ne kumwambileti, “Mwanenu mutukashi usa lafu! Inga mucimumpenshela cani Shikwiyisha?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Nomba Yesu mpwalanyumfwa ibyo byalikwambwa, walamwambila Yailo kwambeti, “Kotatina, kobowa lushomo.” <verse number="37" style="v"/>Yesu nkalasuminisha kuya ne muntu uliyense kupatulakowa Petulo ne Jemusi ne Yohane mukwabo. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Neco balakashika ku ng'anda ya mutangunishi wa ng'anda yakupaililamo, walabona kupilingana kwa bantu balikulila ne kulyuma pa nkombe. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Nomba mpwalengila mukati walambeti, “Inga mulalilingeconi cisa? Mwana uyu uliya kufwa sobwe, nsombi wonatulo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Mpwalamba maswi awa, balatatika kumuseka. Nomba mpwalabapulishamo bonse, walamanta baishi ne banyina bamwana pamo ne beshikwiya batatu mbwalikuba nabo, ne kwingila uko kwalikuba mwana uyo. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Neco walekata cikasa ca mwana mutukashi uyo ne kwambeti, “Talita koumi!” Maswi aya alapandululungeti, “Omulindu obe, ndambanga ne njobe punduka!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Pa cindi copeleco mwana uyu walapunduka ne kutatika kwenda, walikuba wa byaka likumi ne bibili. Nomba bantu balakankamana kwine. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Nomba Yesu walabakonkomesha makanda angi kwambeti kabatambilako uliyense sha bintu ibi, walabambileti “mupeni cakulya.”</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Balamukananga Yesu ku Nasaleti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mateyo 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luka 4:16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu walafumako ne kushika mu cibela ca ku comwabo, neco beshikwiya bakendi balamukonka. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mpobwalashika busuba bwa sabata, nendi walatatika kwiyisha mung'anda yakupaililamo, nomba bantu bangi balamunyumfwa, balakankamana ne kwambeti, “Inga bintu ibi walabicana kupeyo muntuyu? Nipacebo cini mano alicisa alapewa ku muntuyu? Kwambeti bintu bya ngofu shilicisa nendi abinsenga? <verse number="3" style="v"/>Sena nte shikupala mapulanga uyu, mwanendi Maliya, mukwabo Yakobo ne Yose ne Yuda ne Shimoni? Kayi ne bakwabo batukashi ntetuli nabo pano?” Neco balamusula.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nomba Yesu walapitilisha kubambileti, “Mushishimi nkatute kupewa bulemu kucomwabo nambi ne banse bendi nambi ne bamung'anda mucomwabo. Nsombi kumbi.” <verse number="5" style="v"/>Neco calamwemba kwinsako bintu byeshikukankaminisha, nsombi walabika makasa pa balwashi bang'ana ne kubasengula. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Cakubinga, walakankamana pakubula lushomo kwabo. Neco walendana muminshi yapepi kushingulukamo kaya kwiyisha.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu latumunga beshikwiya likumi ne babili.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-5">Mateyo 10:1-5</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 10:9-14">9-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-10:4">Luka 9:1-5—10:4-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yesu walakuwa likumi ne babili ne kubatuma babili babili, ne kubapa ngofu shakupulisha mishimu yaipa. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nomba walabakonkomesheti, “Kamutamanta kantu kalikonse pabulwendo, nsombi nkoli yonka. Kamutamanta shinkwa, nambi mukopa wapabulwendo, nambi mali mubikwama byenu. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ee, mufwale nkwabilo, kamutapamankanya minjila ibili.” <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kayi walabambileti, “Bamutambula mung'anda iliyonse, ikalani mung'andomo mpaka cindi cakufumamo. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Kulikonse nkobalabulu kumutambula, nambi kumunyumfwila, pakufumako mupampamune lusuko lwa ku myendo kwenu kwambeti lube cishibisho cakubacenjesha.” <verse number="12" style="v"/>Neco balanyamuka kuya kukambauka kwambeti bantu bashiye bwipishi bwabo. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Neco balapulisha mishimu yaipa ingi, ne kunanika mafuta balwashi bangi ne kubasengula.</para>
  <para style="s">Lufu lwa Yohane Mubatishi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mateyo 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luka 9:7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Lino ibi byalanyumfwika ku Mwami Helode pakwinga lina lya Yesu lyanyumfwika paliponse, neco bantu balikwambeti, “Yohane Mubatishi lapundushiwa kubafu, ecebo cakendi lenshinga bishikukankaminisha bilicisa.” <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nomba nabambi balikwambeti, “Ni Mushinshimi Eliya” Nsombi nabambi balikwambeti, “Ni mushinshimi mbuli ncobalikuba bashinshimi nabambi bakulukulu” <verse number="16" style="v"/>Helode mpwalanyumfwa walambeti, “Cakubinga uyu ni Yohane Mubatishi usa ngondatimbula mutwi elapundushiwa.” <verse number="17" style="v"/>Pakwinga Helodi mwine ewalatuma bantu kuya kumwikata Yohane, kumusunga ne kumubika mujele. Helode walenseco, pakwinga waleba Helodiya mukashi wa Filipo mukwabo. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Calabeco pakwinga Yohane walikumwambila mankanda angi kwambeti, “Catonda kweba mukashi wa mukwenu” <verse number="19" style="v"/>Neco Helodiya calamunyona kumoyo, walikalangaula mwa kushinina Yohane, nsombi Helodiya calikumwemba. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Helode walikumutina Yohane, pakwinga walikumwinshibeti ni muntu walulama kayi waswepa, neco walikumusunga cena. Nomba mpwalanyumfwa ncalikwamba Yohane walapwilwa mano, Nambi walikuyanda kumunyumfwila mwa kukondwa. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Nomba Helodiya walacaninapo colwe mpobwalashika busuba bwakusekelela kusemwa kwa Helode. Walabambila cakulya camansailo bamanduna bakendi, bashilikali bamakulene, ne batangunishi bayampuwo mu Galileya. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Nomba mwana mutukashi wa Helodiya mpwalengilamo ne kubashanina ca sunsa bukome, walamukondwelesha Helode pamo ne mbwalikulya nabo. Pano Mwami walambila mwana mutukashi eti, “Kosenga ciliconse ncolandanga kuli njame, nindikupe.” <verse number="23" style="v"/>Ea, walensa kulumbileti, “Cakubinga ciliconse ncowelela kusenga kulinjame nindikupe, nambi cimpansha ca bwami bwakame.” <verse number="24" style="v"/>Popelapo walapula ne kuya kwambila banyina kwambeti, “Inga ensenge cani?” Banyina balambeti, “Mutwi wa Yohane Mubatishi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Pa cindi copeleco mutukashi uyu walengila mwabwangu bwangu ne kuya kwalikuba mwami, nekumusenga, “Ndayandanga mumpe mumbale popele pano mutwi wa Yohane.” <verse number="26" style="v"/>Popelapo Mwami Herode calamwikala kumoyo, nomba pakuyeya ncalalumbila, kayi nabo mbwalakuwa kumalyalya asa uliya kuyanda kupwaya maswi ngalambila mutukashi usa. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Pacindi copeleco mwami walatuma mushilikani ne kumukonkomesheti, alete mutwi wa Yohane. Neye walaya kumutimbula mutwi mu Jele, <verse number="28" style="v"/>ne kuleta mumbale, ne kutwala ku mwana mutukashi usa, neye mutukashi uyo walautwala ku banyina. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Beshikwiya bakendi Yohane mpobalanyumfwa balesakumanta citumbi ne kuya kubika mu manda.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lalyeshenga likoto lya bantu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mateyo 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luka 9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yohane 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Lino beshikwiya balabwelela kuli Yesu ne kumwambila byonse mbyebalensa ne kwiyisha. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Kwalikuba bantu bangi balikwisa ne kuya, cakwinseti Yesu ne beshikwiya bakendi balabula cindi cakupumwina, nambi cakwambeti balye cakulya. Neco,walabambileti, “Katuyani kumusena kwabula bantu twenga tupumwineko.” <verse number="32" style="v"/>Neco balatanta bwato, ne kuya kumusena kwabula bantu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Nomba bantu balababona kabanyamuka, balenshiba nkobalikuya. Neco bantu balasokoloka kufuma muminshi ne kufwamba lubilo kuya kopeloko ne kushika bwangu Yesu ne beshikwiya bakendi kabatana bashika. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Lino Yesu mpwalaseluka mu bwato, walabona likoto linene lyabantu, neco walabanyumfwila luse, pakwinga balikubeti mbelele shabula mwembeshi. Walatatika kubeyisha bintu bingi. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Lino mpokwalatatika kushipuluka, beshikwiya bakendi balesa kumwambileti, “Kuno nikucisuwa, kayi naco cindi cilapu. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Kamubambilani bantu benga mu minshi ilipepi kwambeti benga balyulile byakulya.” <verse number="37" style="v"/>Neye Yesu walabambileti, “Amwe njamweti mubape cakulya.” Palico, balo balambeti, “Sena twenga kuyakula shinkwa wa mali ngelakufola muntu pa myenshi isanu ne itatu ne kutwala kubantu aba kwambeti balye?” <verse number="38" style="v"/>Nendi Yesu walabepusheti, “Inga mukuteko shinkwa ungaye? Kamuya mubone!” Mpobalaubona balamwambileti, “Muli shinkwa usanu, kayi ne nswi shibili.” <verse number="39" style="v"/>Palico, Yesu walambila beshikwiya bakendi kwambeti, bekalike panshi bantu mu makoto-makoto pamila yamwemfu. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Neco balekala mumakoto milongo mwanda umo, ukute bantu makumi asanu pa mulongo. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Yesu walamanta shinkwa usanu ne nswi shibili ne kulanga kwilu ne kusenga Lesa, ne kukatika komona shinkwa ne inswi shibili nekupa beshikwiya bakendi, kwambeti nabo bayabile bantu. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Neco bonse balalya ne kwikuta, <verse number="43" style="v"/>Panyuma pakendi beshikwiya basa balayowela byalashalapo bya shinkwa ne nswi, balesusha mitanga likumi ne ibili, <verse number="44" style="v"/>Nomba, bonse abo balalya shinkwa uyo balikuba batuloba bali myanda makumi asanu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lendenga pa menshi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Mateyo 14:22-33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Yohane 6:15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Pacindi copeleco, Yesu walambila beshikwiya bakendi eti batante mu bwato batangune kuya kutala ku Betisaida, nsombi nendi walashalila kacambila bantu kwambeti benga kwabo. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Mpwalalayana nabo bantu, walaya pa mulundu kuya kupaila. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Mansailo mpokwalashipuluka, bwato bwali kabucili pakati pa lwenje, kakuli nendi walikuba enka kumutunta. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Nomba Yesu mpwalababona kabakwasula bwato mwakupenga pakwinga balikulwana ne lukupwe lwa ngofu, camuma 3 koloko kumaca walabakonkela, kaya kwenda palwenje, nomba walayanda nsulo kubapitilila. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Nomba beshikwiya mpobalamubona kenda pa lwenje balayeyeti, “Ni cipuku ici nditu!” Neco kwalaba kubilikisha kwabuyowa. <verse number="50" style="v"/>Pakwinga bonse balamubona neco balatina kwine. Nomba pa cindi copeleco, walabambileti, “Yumishani moyo, njame. Kamutatina!” <verse number="51" style="v"/>Popelapo walatanta nabo mubwato ne lukupwe lwalacileka. Neco balakankamana mu myoyo yabo. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Pakwinga baliya kunyumfwishisha shinkwa usa ne swi, ncalikupandulula, cebo cakwambeti myoyo yabo yalikuba yayuma.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>Nomba lino mpobalatampukila kumutunta, balashika mu Genesalete ne kubwimanika bwato capepi.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lasengulunga balwashi mu Genesalete</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:34-36">Mateyo 14:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v"/>Nomba mpwalaseluka mu bwato bantu balashikila kumwinshiba Yesu. <verse number="55" style="v"/>Neco bantu bamu misena yonse balafwamba uku ne uku ne kunyamuna balwashi pa mampasa, kuya nabo uko nkobalanyumfeti nkwabele. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Calaba cakwinseti mumunshi mwalengili, nambi mu minshi inene inene, nambi mumisena yashinguluka iliyonse, bantu balikwikalika balwashi mumisena ya makwebo. Balikumusengeti bakumyeko kucelele kwamwinjila wakendi wakunsa. Neco bangi balakumya ne kusenguka.</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Miyambo ya bamashali babo bakulukulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:1-9">Mateyo 15:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Bafalisi ne beshikwiyisha milawo nabambi balafumina ku Yelusalemu, balamubunganina Yesu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Lino balaboneti beshikwiya nabambi balalinga shinkwa kwakubula kusamba kumakasa mbuli mulawo wa Bafalisi nceulambanga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Pakwinga Bafalisi ne Bayuda bonse nkabakute kulya kwakubula kusamba kumakasa mbuli mwambo wabakulukulu nceulambanga. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Weco bafuma kumakwebo, nkabali kubilya kabatana babiswepesha nanshi. Kayi pali miyambo ingi njobalatambula ne kwisunga, mbuli kusuka mipika nkomeshi ne mbale kayi ne <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Malili nkalipo mu mipukutu yakaindi sobwe</char></note>malili.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Neco aba Bafalisi ne beshikwiyisha milawo balamwipusheti, “Inga nipacebo cini beshikwiya bakobe ncobabulilinga kukonka mwambo wa bakulukulu. Balo balalinga cakulya ne makasa ashilila?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesu walabakumbuleti, “Yesaya walamba cakubinga pakwamba sha bandemi shibili amwe, mbuli Mabala ncakute kwambeti,”</para>
  <para style="q">Bantu aba bakute kumpa bulemu ne milomo yabo,</para>
  <para style="q">nsombi myoyo yabo ili kutali nenjame.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>“Bakute kunkambilila pabulyo,</para>
  <para style="q">pakwinga bakute kwiyisha milawo yabantu</para>
  <para style="q">kubeti biyisho bya Lesa!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>“Mukute kubika palubasu milawo ya Lesa, ne kuyuminina nta ku mwambo wa bantu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kayi walabambileti, “Mubucenjeshi bwenu mukute kunyakila palubasu milawo ya Lesa kwambeti musunge mwambo wenu. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Pakwinga Mose walambeti, ‘Kopa bulemu baiso ne banyoko,’ Kayi walambeti, ‘Uliyense lanyanshanga baishi ne banyina ashinwe.’ <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nomba amwe mukute kwambeti muntu ambila baishi nambi banyina, nconkute, ncomwayandangeti ndimunyamfweko, ni kwambeti, ‘ni Kobani (uku ekwambeti cintu ico cilabengwa kuli Lesa). <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nkamukute kumusuminisheti asebensele baishi nambi banyina munshila iliyonse, <verse number="13" style="v"/>pakwinseco maswi a Lesa akute kuba abulyo pacebo ca mwambo wenu ngomwalatwalila bantu. Kayi mukute kwinsa bintu bingi byakoshana nebi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Bintu bikute kusafwanya muntu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:10-20">Mateyo 15:10-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Neco Yesu walakuwa likoto lisa lya bantu, ne kutatika kwamba nalyo, “Kamunyumfwani kuno mwense, munyumfwishishe bupandulushi bwakendi. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Paliya ciliconse cishikufuma kunsa kwa muntu cikute kwingila mumubili mwakendi celela kusafwanya muntu, nsombi bintu bikute kupula mu muntu ebikute kusafwanya muntu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>“Ukute matwi Anyumfwe.” <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalafuma palikoto lya bantu walakengila mung'anda, beshikwiya bakendi balatatika kumwipusha sha mukoshano usa. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesu walabambileti, “Sena nenjamwe nkamuncishi kwambeti paliya cishikufuma kunsa ne kwingila mu mubili wa muntu celela kumusafwanya, <verse number="19" style="v"/>pakwinga nkacikute kwingila mumoyo, nsombi mumila yakendi. Neco cikute kupula nekuya kucitaila kucisuwa” Palico byakulya byonse byaswepa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kayi walambeti, “cishikufuma mu muntu ecikute kusafwanya muntu, <verse number="21" style="v"/>pakwinga mukati mu moyo wa muntu, mukute kupula miyeyo yaipa yakwinsa bufule, ya bwibi, yabukapondo, <verse number="22" style="v"/>yabupombo, yakukumbwa kwa munyono, kwinsa byaipa, bwepeshi, bwikalo bwacendende, liso lyalunkumbwa, lunkanwa, kulibonabuntu, kwinsa bintu kwa buluya. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Byonsebi byaipa ebikute kupula mukati ne kusafwanya muntu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Lushomo lwa Mutukashi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:21-28">Mateyo 15:21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalafumako walengila mubibela bya Tulo ne Sidoni. Walaya kwingila mung'anda, neco nkalikuyandeti muntu uliyense enshibe. Nikukabeco bantu balenshiba. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Neco pacindi copeleco mutukashi walikukute mwana mutukashi wekatwa ne mushimu waipa, walanyumfwa sha Yesu, walesa kusuntama pa myendo yakendi. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Mutukashi uyu walikuba mu Giliki walasemenwa mu cibela ca Siliya calikukwiweti Foinike. Neco walamusenga Yesu tunkanda twingi kwambeti apulishe mushimu mu mwanendi mutukashi. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Nomba nendi walatatika kwambeti, “Cakutanguna bana ebelela nanshi kwikuta, pakwinga nkacaina kumanta cakulya ca bana ne kupa bakabwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Nomba pakukumbula nendi mutukashi walambeti, “Nicakubinga Nkambo, nomba nabo bakabwa bona mwinshi mutebulu bakute kupembelela kulya bilalashanga bana panshi.” Mpwalanyumfwa maswi alico walamwambila mutukashi, <verse number="29" style="v"/>“Pakwinga ulambeco, koya, mushimu waipa ulapulumo mu mwanobe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Neco walaya kung'anda kwakendi nekucana mwanendi kali walambalala pabulili mushimu kauli ulapulumo kendi.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lasengulunga muntu utanyumfu kayi utamba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Lino mpwalikubwela kufuma mubibela bya Tulo, walapita pakati pa Sidoni ne kushika kulwenje lwa Galileya ne kupita mu Cimpansha caminshi likumi. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Kopeloko bantu balamuletela muntu washinka matwi, kayi wakamama, balamusengeti abike cikasa cakendi palyendiye. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Nomba Yesu walamanta muntuyo pakati pa likoto lya bantu nekuya nendi palubasu. Kopeloko walengisha minwe yakendi mu matwi a muntuyo kayi walasanka mata ne kwikata lulemi lwakendi. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Popelapo walalanga kwilu walashinshimuka ne kwambeti, “Ephphata,” Uku ekwambeti, “Caluka.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Popelako matwi akendi alacaluka, lulemi lwakendi lwalikuba lwasungika lwalasunguluka, walatatika kwamba cena cena. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Yesu walabakonkomesheti, “Kamutambilako uliyense,” Nomba balo empobalikuya kwamba kulikonse. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Cakubinga balikukankamana ne kwambeti, “Bintu byonse labinshi cena nditu, bashinka matwi balanyumfunga, ne bacibulu balambanga.”</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu lalyeshenga bantu bali myanda makumi ana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:32-39">Mateyo 15:32-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Paliyawa kupita cindi citali sobwe, kayi bantu bangi balabungana kuli Yesu, nomba nkabalikukute cakulya,Yesu walakuwa beshikwiya bakendi ne kubambileti, <verse number="2" style="v"/>“Ndanyumfwilinga luse bantu aba, pakwinga balekala ne njame kwa masuba atatu, kwabula cakulya. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Na ndibambileti benga kwabo kabali ne nsala, nibawisukenga mu nshila, pakwinga nabambi bafuma kutali.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Beshikwiya bakendi balamwipusheti, “Nikupeyo muntu nkwelela kucana shinkwa wingi wakulyesha aba bantu bonse mucisuwa muno?” <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nendi Yesu walabepusheti, “Inga mukuteko shinkwa ungaye?” Nabo balakumbuleti, “Usanu ne ubili.” <verse number="6" style="v"/>Lino walabambila bantu kwambeti bekale panshi. Neco walamanta shinkwa usanu ne ubili, walalumbaisha Lesa, walakomauna, nekupa beshikwiya bakendi kwambeti bayabile likoto lya bantu. Naboyo balensa copeleco. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Kayi balikukute tunswi twakubelengowa, walalumbaisha Lesa ne kubambileti nato batuyabe. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Neco bonse balalya ne kwikuta, cakwinseti balayowela bishikulaka panshi ne kwisusha mitanga inene inene isanu ne ibili. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Palikuba bantu bashika pepi myanda makumi ana, Yesu balabambileti benga kwabo. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Popelapo Yesu, walatanta mubwato pamo ne beshikwiya bakendi ne kuya ku cibela ca Dalamanuta.</para>
  <para style="s">Bafalisi balayandanga cingashilo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Mateyo 12:38-42</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:1-4">16:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Kopeloko kwalashika Bafalisi balatatika kutotekeshana ne Yesu. Balikuyandeti ababoneshe chinshibisho chishikufumina kwilu pakuyanda kumwelekesha. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yesu walashinshimuka mumoyo wakendi, walambeti, “Sena niciyani musemanowu colayandilinga kubona cinshibisho? Cakubinga ndambangeti, musemanowu nteti ukapewepo chinshibisho ciliconse sobwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Mpwalambeco walabashiya ne kutanta bwato kuya kutala kwa lwenje.</para>
  <para style="s">labacenjeshenga ne ciyisho ca Bafalisi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:5-12">Mateyo 16:5-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nomba, balalubako kumanta shinkwa wingi, neco nkabalikukute ciliconse mubwatomo, nsombi shinkwa umowa. <verse number="15" style="v"/>walabacenjesheti, “Calukani menso! Cetukani ne cishikufufumusha ca Bafalisi ne ca Helode.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Neco balatatika kukangana umo ne munendi pa nkani yakubula shinkwa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu pakwinshibeco, walabambileti, “Inga mulakanganangeconi pa nkani yakubula shinkwa. Sena mpaka pacindi cino nkamuna munyumfwishisha ne kwinshiba bupandulushi bwakendi? Sena myoyo yenu icili mungubi? <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nambi menso mulinawo sena nkamulabonesheshenga? Matwi mulinao sena nkamulanyumfwishishinga? Sena nkamulanukunga? <verse number="19" style="v"/>Pasa mpondala komauna shinkwa usanu kwambeti ndyeshe batuloba myanda makumi asanu, sena mwalesusha mitanga ingaye ya byashalapo?” Beshikwiya bakumbuleti, “Likumi ne ibili.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesu walabepusheti “Mpondalakomauna shinkwa usanu ne ubili ne kulyesha batuloba myanda makumi ana, mwalesusha mitanga ingaye?” Balakumbuleti “Isanu ne ibili” <verse number="21" style="v"/>Popelapo walambeti, “Sena nkamuna mwinshiba ncocilapandululunga?”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lasengulunga muntu washipilwa ku Betisaida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesu ne beshikwiya bakendi balashika ku Betisaida, uku bantu balamuletela muntu washipilwa, balamupapatila kwambeti amwikatekowa muntuyo. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Popelapo Yesu walamwikata muntu washipilwa pacikasa nekuya nendi kunsa kwa munshi walamusankila mata mumenso ne kubika makasa palyendiye, ne kumwipusheti “Sena pali ncolabonongaponga?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Muntu washipilwa usa walakapula ne kukumbuleti, “Ee ndabononga bantu balendendenga.” Nomba balabonekengeti, “bitondo.” <verse number="25" style="v"/>Kayi Yesu walabika makasa pamenso a muntu usa, neco walakapula nekutatika kubona. Walaba cena ne kuboneshesha cena bintu byonse. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesu walamwambileti koya kucomwenu, ne kumwambilisheti, “Kotabwela mumunshiwu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Klistu ni Mupulushi Wasala ne Lesa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-20">Mateyo 16:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luka 9:18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yesu ne beshikwiya bakendi pacindici balaya ku minshi yaku Kaisaleya waku Filipi. Mpobalikuya munshila, Yesu walabepusheti, “Inga bantu balambangeti njame bani?” <verse number="28" style="v"/>Balo beshikwiya bakendi balamukumbuleti, “Bambi balambangeti njamwe Yohane Mubatishi, nabambi balambangeti njamwe Eliya. Nsombi nabambi balambangeti, njamwe umo wabashinshimi bakulukulu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu walabepusheti, “Inga amwe mulambangeti njame bani?” Petulo walakumbuleti, “Amwe Njamwe Klistu Mupulushi Wasalalwa ne Lesa.” <verse number="30" style="v"/>Neco Yesu walabambileti, “Kamutambilapo muntu uliyense shanjame.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lambanga sha mapensho ne Lufu lwakendi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:21-28">Mateyo 16:21-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luka 9:22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yesu popelapo walatatika kubeyisha beshikwiya bakendi kwambeti, “Mwana Muntu welela kunyumfwa bishikubaba, kupenshewa ne kukanwa ne beshimilumbo milumbo, ne bashikwiyisha milawo ne kumushina. Nsombi pabusuba bwatutatu, nakapundushiwe kubafu.” <verse number="32" style="v"/>Yesu walabambila makani awa pantangalala. Nomba nendi Petulo walamutwala Yesu pa lubasu ne kumukansa. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Nendi Yesu walacebuka ne kulangila kwalikuba beshikwiya bakendi nabambi, ne kumucancalila Petulo mwabukalu eti. “Koyoko Satana obe, pakwinga miyeyo yakobe niya buntu, nteyo miyeyo ya Lesa sobwe!.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Panyuma pakendi, Yesu walakuwa likoto lya bantu pamo ne beshikwiya bakendi, nekubambileti, “Muntu layandanga kunkonka ame alikane mwine, kayi alibambile kupeshewa, ne kufwa cebo ca kunkonkela. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Pakwinga uliyense layandanga kupulusha buyumi bwakendi mwine, nakabutaye. Nomba uyo latayanga buyumi bwakendi pa cebo cakame, ne pacebo ca makani awa ayina, cakubinga nendi nakabupulushe. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Inga caina cilipo nicipeyo na muntu uba ne bintu byonse bili pacishi capanshi, nomba ubutaya buyumi bwakendi butapu? <verse number="37" style="v"/>Inga nicani ico muntu ncelela kutika kwambeti buyumi bwancinencine butapu? <verse number="38" style="v"/>Abo balanyumfwilinga insoni ne maswi akame pamenso abantu babula lushomo,kayi babwipishi, bopelabo Mwana Muntu nakabanyumfwile insoni akesanga pamo ne bangelo mu Mulemu bwa Baishi.”</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu walapitilisha kubambileti, “Cakubinga ndamwambilishingeti, popele pano, mpobali nabambi beti bakabule kufwa kabatana babubona Bwami bwa Lesa kabwisa ne ngofu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kusanduka kwa ciwa ca Yesu.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-13">Mateyo 17:1-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luka 9:28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mpopalapita masuba asanu ne bumo, Yesu walamanta Petulo ne Jemusi ne Yohane ne kuya nabo pa mulundu utali pabonka, kopeloko ciwa ca Yesu walasanduka kabalangilisha ne menso abo. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Balabona mwinjila wakendi ncowalatatika kubemba, walabemba kupita byakufwala bilibyonse ibyo muntu mbyelela kucapa pano pacishi capanshi ne kubitubisha. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yesu walaboneka kuli beshikwiya kabandika ne Mose ne Eliya. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Petulo mpwalaboneco walamba kuli Yesu eti, “Bashikwiyisha, caina kwambeti mpotuli pano, neco twibake mishasha itatu, umo ube wenu, naumbi ube wa Mose, kayi naumbi ube wa Eliya.” <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nsombi Petulo walabula cakwamba pakwinga bonse balaba ne buyowa bunene.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Likumbi lyalesa kubafwekelela popelapo, ne liswi lyalanyumfwika mulikumbi akwambeti, “Uyu e Mwaname ngonsuni. Kamumunyumfwilani!” <verse number="8" style="v"/>Mpobalacebukila uku ne uku beshikwiya aba balabonowa Yesu kaliyenka, nabambi mbwambanga nabo kucana paliya. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Mpobalikuselela kufuma pa mulundu, Yesu walabambilisheti, “Ncomulabono kamutaya mwambileko muntu uliyense, mpaka panyuma pa kupunduka kubafu kwa Mwana Muntu.” <verse number="10" style="v"/>Maswi awa balasunga mucali mwabo, nomba balikabepushana palwabo eti, “Sena kupunduka kubafu nkwalambanga Yesu uku kulapandululunga cani?” <verse number="11" style="v"/>Neco beshikwiya balamwipusha Yesu eti, “Nipacebo cini beshikwiyisha Milawo ncobakute kwambileti welela kwisa cakutanguna ni Eliya?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nendi Yesu walabakumbuleti, “Nicakubinga Eliya welela kwisa cakutanguna, ne kubamba bintu byonse, nsombi kwalembweconi sha Mwana Muntu kwambeti welela kucana mapensho mangi ne kumukana? <verse number="13" style="v"/>Ame ndamwambilingeti Eliya wesakendi, ne bantu bensa kendi ciliconse ncobayandanga kwinsa, mbuli nceca lembwa mu Mabala.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Lasengulunga kanike mutuloba ukute mushimu waipa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-21">Mateyo 17:14-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luka 9:37-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Mpobalabwelela kwalashala beshikwiya nabambi, balabona likoto lya bantu bangi kabali babashinguluka kabatotekeshanya ne beshikwiyisha Milawo. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Bantu bonse balakankamana mpobalamubona Yesu, balamufwambila kuya kumushisha. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nendi Yesu walabepusha beshikwiya, “Inga nipacebo cini mpomulatotekeshanyanga ne bantu aba?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Muntu umo walikuba mulikoto lyabantu walakumbuleti, “Bashikwiyisha, ndalete kulinjamwe mwaname mutuloba ukute mushimu wabucibulu. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ukute kumwuwishila panshi, ne kupula mapofu kumulomo, ne kutatika kukokota meno, kulikonse nkolamwikatili, ukute ubula ne ngofu. Neco ndanga ndambili beshikwiya benu kwambeti baupulishemo, nomba cilabalili.” <verse number="19" style="v"/>Nendi Yesu walabambileti, “Mawe! Ninjikale nenu kwa masuba angaye amwe musemano wabula lushomo ndimulekeleleni cindi citali aconi? Kamumuletani kuli njame”. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Naboyo balamutwala kuli Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p">Nomba mushimu waipa mpowalamubona Yesu, mwana mutuloba usa walamuwisha panshi ne kufulumuka fulumuka uku kapula lipofu ku mulomo. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu walepusha baishi kwambeti, “Inga cilamanta cindi citali cilyeconi mwana kalicisa?”</para>
  <para style="p">Baishi balambeti, “Kufuma kubutwanike, <verse number="22" style="v"/>Pakwinga tunkanda twingi mushimuwu ukute kuyanda kumushina, pakumuwala pa mulilo. Kayi ne mu menshi. Na ngamwinsapo ciliconse! Kamutunyumfwilako luse mutunyamfweko.” <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu walambeti, “Inga mulambilinga cani eti na ngamwinsapo ciliconse? Cintu ciliconse cinga kukonsheka kuli uyo ukute lushomo.” <verse number="24" style="v"/>Nabo baishi popelapo balolobesha ne kwambeti, “Ndashoma, nomba kamunyamfwani pakubula lushomo kwakame!” <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yesu pakubona likoto lya bantu lyalikwisa lubilo apo mpobalikuba, walawambila mwabukalu mushimuwo walikumwalisha kunyumfwa ne kwamba walambeti, “Obe mushimu wabucibulu fuma mu muntu uyu kotakabwelamo kayi!” <verse number="26" style="v"/>Neco mushimuwo walolobesha ne kumunyukumuna cangofu mwanoyo, ne kupulamo, nomba walaboneketi citumbi, cakuwinseti bantu balikubapo balambeti, “Lafu!” <verse number="27" style="v"/>Nomba Yesu walamwikata kucikasa kumunyamfwilisha kupunduka neco walapunduka. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Lino Yesu mpwalengila mung'anda, beshikwiya bakendi balatatika kumwipusha kumbali, “Inga afwe catwalilangeconi kupulisha mushimu usa?” <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu walakumbuleti, “Paliya cintu nacimbi celela kukonsha kupulisha mushimu wa mushobowu, nsombi mupailo.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lambanga ponga katubili sha lufu lwakendi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mateyo 17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43b-45">Luka 9:43b-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yesu ne beshikwiya bakendi mpobalafumako balapitilila mu cibela ca Galileya, pakwinga nkabalikuyandeti bantu benshibeti lapitinga. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Pakwinga walikwiyisha beshikwiya bakendi eti, “Mwana Muntu nakatwalwe mu makasa abantu, beti bakamushine, nomba nakapunduke pa busuba bwa butatu.” <verse number="32" style="v"/>Beshikwiya baliya kunyumfwishisha ncali kwamba maswi awa, kayi balikutina kumwipusha.</para>
  <para style="s">Niyani mukulene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mateyo 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luka 9:46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Yesu pamo ne beshikwiya bakendi mpobalashika ku Kapelenawo, balengila mung'anda, walabepusheti, “Inga mwatotekeshanyanga cani pomwesanga munshila?” <verse number="34" style="v"/>Balo balamwena tonto, pakwinga mpobesanga munshila batotekeshanyanga kuyanda kwinshiba mukulene pakati pabo niyani. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Neco Yesu walekala panshi nekubakuwa bonse beshikwiya likumi ne babili, ne kubambileti “Namuntu layandanga kuba mutanshi abe wakupwililisha pali bonse, kayi abe musha wa bonse.” <verse number="36" style="v"/>Yesu walamanta mwana ne kumwimanika pakati pabo ne kumufukata ne kubambileti, <verse number="37" style="v"/>“Uliyense latambulunga mwana ulyeti uyu pacebo canjame, ekwambeti latambulu ame. Kayi uyo latambulunga ame, latambulunga Bata abo balantuma ame.”</para>
  <para style="s">Uyo nendi labulunga kutoteka afwe uli kulubasu lwetu.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:49-50">Luka 9:49-50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Yohane walambeti, “Bashikwiyisha twabona muntu kapulisha mushimu waipa kasebensesha lina lyenu, nomba afwe twamukanisha kwambeti nkelela kwinseco pakwinga nte umo wa njafwe sobwe.” <verse number="39" style="v"/>Nendi Yesu walambeti, “Kamutamukanisha sobwe, pakwinga paliya welela kwinsa bintu bya ngofu mbulibyo kusebensesha lina lyakame welela kayi kungalukila cabwangu bwangu. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Pakwinga uyo labulunga kutoteka afwe uli kulubasu lwetu. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Nicakubinga pakwinga uyo lamupanga nkomeshi ya menshi akunwa, pacebo cakwambeti mobakame, cakubinga nteti akabule kupewa cilambo celela.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kusunkwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-9">Mateyo 18:6-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luka 17:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Nsombi uliyense lapambulunga bana bashoma aba pa nshila yalulama, ingaciba cena kumusungilila cilibwe cinene munshingo ne kumuwala mu lwenje. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Neco na cikasa cakobe cilakwipishinga ucitimbule, cilicena kuya kucana buyumi kokute cikasa cimo kupita kuwalwa mu gehena mu mulilo utashimiki kokute makasa onse abili. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Kopeloko mapila eshi kubapensha nkafu, kayi nawo mulilo weshukabatentenga nteti ukashimikenga sobwe.<note caller="+" style="f"/> <verse number="45" style="v"/>Kayi na mwendo wakobe ula kwipishinga pa utimbule, pakwinga cilicena kuya kucana buyumi kokute mwendo umo kupita kuba ne myendo ibili ne kuwalwa mu gehena. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Kopeloko mapila eshikubapensha nkafu, kayi nawo mulilo weshukabatentenga nteti ukashimikenga sobwe.<note caller="+" style="f"/> <verse number="47" style="v"/>Kayi na linso lyakobe lilakwipishinga, koli kolobolamo ne kulitaya, pakwinga cili cena kuya kwingila mu Bwami bwa Lesa ne liso limo, kupita kuwalwa mu Gehena kokute menso onse abili. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Kopeloko mapila eshi kubapensha nkafu, kayi nawo mulilo weshukabatentenga nteti ukashimikenga sobwe <verse number="49" style="v"/>“Pakwinga uliyense nakaswepeshewe ne mulilo mbuli mulumbo ncokute kuswepeshewa ne mucele. <verse number="50" style="v"/>Mucele waina, nomba na mucele usambuluka niyani kayi welela kubwesheti unyumfwike mbuli ncowabanga pakutanguna? Kamubani ne cintu cishikumuswepeshewa mubuymi mbuli mucele. Kamwikalani mu lumuno pakati penu.”</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Makani akulekana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:1-12">Mateyo 19:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luka 16:18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Kayi Yesu pakufuma ku Kapelenawo, walapita mu cimpansha ca Yudeya kutala kwa mulonga wa Yolodano. Bantu bangi balamubunganina, neye walatatika kubeyisha pakwinga ecalikuba cinga cakendi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Lino kwalashika Bafalisi nabambi balesa kumutapa mukanwa pakumwipusheti, “Sena mulawo wasuminisha mutuloba kuleka mukashendi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Neye walabepusheti, “Inga Mose walamupa mulawo ulyeconi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nabo balamukumbuleti, “Mose walasuminisha mutuloba kumuleka mukashendi ne kumulembela cipepala cabushike ne kumutwala kucomwabo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesu walambeti, “Mose walamulembela mulawo uwu pacebo ca kuyuma mitwi kwenu. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nsombi pacitatiko Lesa mpwalalenga bintu byonse, mbuli mabala ncalambanga, Lesa ‘walababumba mutuloba ne mutukashi.’ <verse number="7" style="v"/>Pacebo ici, mutuloba nakashiye baishi ne banyina ne kuya kupamankana pamo ne mukashendi. <verse number="8" style="v"/>weco aba bantu babili nibakabe umo. Neco nkabacilipo babili sobwe, nsombi umo. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Neco aba babili Lesa mbwalapamankanya pamo, kapataba muntu shikubapansanya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Mpobalabwela mu ng'anda, beshikwiya balatatika kayi kumwipusha sha makani ngwambanga. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nsombi nendi Yesu walabambileti, “Na mutuloba uleka mukashi ne kweba mutukashi naumbi, ukute mulandu wa bupombo pakwinga lepishili mukashendi. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Neye mukashi aleka mulume wakendi ne kuya kwebwa kumutuloba naumbi, neye ukute mulandu wabupombo.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lapanga colwe batwanike</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mateyo 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luka 18:15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Popelapo bantu nabambi balaleta bana babo kuli Yesu kwambeti abekate makasa ne kubapa colwe, nsombi beshikwiya balakalalila bantu abo balaleta bana kwambeti abape colwe. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalaboneco, walabakalilila beshikwiya bakendi ne kubambileti, “Balekeni bana bese kuno kuli njame. Kamutabakanishanga sobwe. Pakwinga bantu balyeti bana aba, Bwami bwa Lesa nibwabo. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Ndamwambilishinga cakubinga kwambeti uyo eti abule kutambula Bwami bwa Lesa eti mwana, nteti akaingilemo.” <verse number="16" style="v"/>Popelapo Yesu walabafukata bana ne kubika makasa akendi palyendibo kwambeti abape colwe.</para>
  <para style="s">Mutuloba wa bubile</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mateyo 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luka 18:18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalatatika bulwendo, muntu naumbi walamufwambila. Walashika ne kwisa kusuntama pantangu ne kumwipusheti, “Amwe bashikwiyisha baina, inga ni cani ncondelela kwinsa kwambeti nkatambule buyumi bwa cindi conse?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Popelapo nendi Yesu walamukumbuleti, “Inga ni pacebo cini mpolang'ambanga ame kuba waina? Paliya muntu waina nsombi Lesa enka. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Winshi milawo; Kotashina, kotapombola, kotaiba, kotamba bukamboni bwabwepeshi, kotapamba camunobe, kopa bulemu baiso ne banyoko.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nendi walambeti, “Bashikwiyisha ibi ndalatatika kubikonka kufumina kubutwanike bwakame.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu walamulangishisha ne lusuno, ne kumwambileti, “Ucili wapelebelako cintu cimo. Koya ulishe bintu byonse mbyokute. Mali ngoshucanemo upe bantu bapenshi, wenseco,buboni bwakobe nukabucane kwilu. Panyuma pakendi wise ukonke.” <verse number="22" style="v"/>Mpwalanyumfwa maswi awo, walawisha cinso walafumapo kaliwongumana, pakwinga walikuba mubile.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu walacebukila beshikwiya bakendi ne kubambileti, “Nicapatali kubantu bakute buboni kwambeti bakengile mu Bwami bwa Lesa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Maswi awa alabakankamanisha beshikwiya. Kayi Yesu walabweshapo kwambeti, “Cakubinga, amwe bana bame, nicapatali kuya kwingila mu Bwami bwa Lesa, <verse number="25" style="v"/>cakonsheka munyama ukute kukwiweti ngamila kwambeti apite mukamulyango ka nyeleti, kupita kwambeti muntu ukute buboni akengile mu Bwami bwa Lesa?”<figure style="fig" desc="" file="14 Camel.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="10:25">Ngamila</figure></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Popelapo beshikwiya balaba ne buyowa ne kutatika kwipushaneti, “Nomba na ncocibeleco niyani welela kupuluka?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yesu walabalangishisha, ne kubambileti, “Nkacikonsheke kwelana ne kuyeya kwa bantu, nomba kuli Lesa nendi paliya camukoma. Pakwinga kuli Lesa byonse bikute kukonsheka.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Popelapo Petulo walatatika kwamba ne Yesu, “Kamubonani afwe twalashiya byonse kwambeti twendenga nenu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu walambeti, “Cakubinga ndamwambilishinga uyo walashiya ng'anda, nambi bakwabo batuloba nebatukashi, nambi baishi, nambi banabendi, nambi mabala pacebo cakame, ne Mulumbe Waina, <verse number="30" style="v"/>nakatambule mwanda wabintu byapita mbyalikuba nabyo pacindi cino, mbuli ng'anda ne bakwabo batuloba ne batukashi, banyina ne bana ne mabala, kubikapo ne mapensho. Uyu pacindi ca pantangu nakatambule buyumi butapu. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Nomba bantu bangi bali kuntangu nibakabe kunyuma, abo bali kunyuma nibakabe kuntangu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu labambililinga kacitatu sha lufu lwa kendi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mateyo 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luka 18:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Mpobalikuba pabulwendo bwakuya ku Yelusalemu, Yesu walikwendela capantangu pa beshikwiya, nabo beshikwiya balikuba bayakamwa, nabo bantu balikubakonkela balikukute buyowa. Yesu walabakuwa palubasu beshikwiya likumi ne babili, ne kutatika kubambila bintu byeshi binshike. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Walambeti, “Kamubonani tuli pa bulwendo bwakuya ku Yelusalemu. Twakashika Mwana Muntu nakekatwe ne kutwalwa kuli beshimilumbo bamakulene ne ku beshikwiyisha milawo. Beti bakamomboloshe ne kusuminishana sha kumushina. Kayi ni bakamutwale kubantu bamishobo naimbi. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Beti bakamunyanshe ne kumusankila mata, ne kumukwapula kayi ne kumushina. Nomba pakapita masuba atatu nendi nakamupundushiwe kubafu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Jemusi ne Yohane balasengenga kuli Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:20-28">Mateyo 20:20-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Jemusi ne Yohane, banabendi Sebedayo balamwipusha Yesu kwambeti, “Bashikwiyisha, tusuni kwambeti mutwinshile cili conse nceti tusenge.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Yesu walabepusheti, “Inga mulayandanga ndimwinshileni cani?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Nabo balakumbuleti, “tulayandangeti mutusuminisheti umo palinjafwe tobabili akekale ku cikasa cakululyo naumbi kucikasa cakucipiko, mwakekala mu bulemeneno bwa Bwami.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Nomba Yesu walabambileti, “Nkamucinshi ncomulasengenga. Sena ngamucikonsha kunwa munkomeshi ya mapensho njoti nkanwemo? Nambi kubatishiwa mulubatisho ndoti mbatishiwe?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Nabo balamukumbuleti, “Cakubinga, ingatucikonsha.”</para>
  <para style="p">Palico Yesu walabambileti, “Ingacibeco, nkomeshi njoti nkanwemo, nenjamwe ningamunwamo, ne lubatisho ndoti nkatambule nenjamwe nimukalutambule. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Nomba ame ntameti nkasale muntu shikwikala kucikasa ca kululyo nambi ku cikasa cakucipiko. Lesa mwine eti akape kwa kwikala abo babambilwa misena.” <verse number="41" style="v"/>Mpobalanyumfwako banabo bali likumi balakalalila Jemusi ne Yohane. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Yesu walakuwa beshikwiya bakendi, ne kubambileti, “Mucinshi cena kwambeti pakati pa bantu bakunsa, bantu bakute kutangunina bakute kulyela bantu babo masuku pamutwi. Bamakulene babo bakute kubonesha ngofu shabo pa bantu babo. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Nomba nkacelela kubeco pakati palinjamwe sobwe. Uliyense layandanga kuba mukulene pakati palinjamwe, abe musebenshi wenu. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Uliyense layandanga kuba mutangunishi wapita bonse pakati penu abe musha wa bonse. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Pakwinga nambi Mwana Muntu uliya kwisa kusebenselwa, nsombi kulipa mwine kuba musebenshi, ne kubenga buyumi bwakendi kwambeti alubule bantu bangi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lasengulunga Batimeyo washipilwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mateyo 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luka 18:35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Yesu ne beshikwiya bakendi balashika ku Yeliko. Nomba Yesu ne beshikwiya ne likoto linene mpobalikupula mu Yeliko, balacana muntu washipilwa walikukute cinga cakusengasenga kali wekala mumbali mwanshila, muntuyu walikuba Batimeyo mwanendi Timeyo. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Mpwalanyumfwa kwambeti Yesu wa ku Nasaleti elapitinga, walatatika kubilikisha, “Yesu mwanendi Dafeti! Kamunyumfwilako nkumbo!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>Nabambi bantu balamucanchilila kwambeti amwene, nomba nendi empwalapitilisha kubilikisha, “Mwanendi Dafeti kamunyumfwilako nkumbo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Yesu walemana ne kwambila beshikwiya bakendi eti, “Mukuweni ese kuno.” Neco balamukuwa ne kumwambileti, “Yumisha moyo! Nyamuka! Yesu lakukunga.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Neco muntu washipilwa uyu walafulula mwinjila ne kuwala panshi nekulukila mwilu ne kwisa kuli Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>Yesu walamwipusheti, “Ulayandanga ndikwinshile cani?” Washipilwa uyo wakumbuleti, “Bashikwiyisha ndayandangeti ntatike kubona.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>“Koya lushomo lwakobe lulapeshepeti ube cena,” Popelapo walatatika kubona cena, ne kukonkela Yesu pabulwendo.</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu lengilinga mu Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mateyo 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luka 19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yohane 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Mpobalashika ku Yelusalemu pepi ne minshi ya Betifagi ne Betani mumbali mwa mulundu wa Maolifi, Yesu walatuma beshikwiya babili. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ne kubambileti, “Kamuyani mu mushi ngomulabononga usa, mwengila nimucane mwanambongolo wasungwa, utana utantwapo ne muntu, mumusungulule mumulete kuno. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Na muntu naumbi amwipusheti ingamula mutwalanga kupeyo, mumwambileti Mwami layandanga kumusebensesha, apwisha na mulete kayi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Neco mpobalaya balacana mwanambongolo, kaliwasungililwa pa cishinga pepi ne nshila, nabo balamusungulula. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Bantu balikuba pepi balepusheti, “Inga mulamusungululwinga cani?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nabo balakumbula mbuli Yesu ncalabambila. Neco balabasuminisha beshikwiya. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Nabo balamuleta mwanambongolo kuli Yesu, ne kubika cikwisa pa musana pa mwanambongolo kwambeti aikalepo Yesu. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Bantu bangi balayansa bikwisa byabo panshila, nabambi balatimbula misampi yatutondo twamulibala. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Bantu bonse balikuba pantangu ne abo balikuba kunyuma balatatika kubilikisheti,</para>
  <para style="q">“Lesa alumbaishiwe! Lesa ape colwe uyo lesanga mulina lya Mwami.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Lesa ape colwe Bwami</para>
  <para style="q">bulesanga bwa Dafeti mushali wetu.</para>
  <para style="q">Lesa wa Kwilu kumayoba alumbaishiwe!”</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalashika mu Yelusalemu, walengila mu Ng'anda ya Lesa, ne kulanga langa byonse. Pakwinga calikuba kendi cindi ca mansailo, walapula ne kuya ku Betani pamo ne beshikwiya likumi ne babili.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lashingananga citondo ca mukuyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:18-19">Mateyo 21:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Mpobwalaca mumene Yesu walanyumfwa nsala pakufuma ku Betani. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kaciliko patali walabona citondo ca mukuyu cikute matewu, walaya pepi kwambeti abone mpani inga kacikute nkuyu, nsombi mpwalashika mwinshi walacaneti cikute matewu onka, pakwinga nkacalikuba cindi cakuba ne nkuyu. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Neco, Yesu walacambileti, “Paliya muntu eshakalyeko nkuyu ku citondo ici!” Beshikwiya bakendi balamunyumfwa kambeco.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lenga ku Ng'anda ya Lesa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mateyo 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luka 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yohane 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Lino Yesu mpwalashika ku Yelusalemu walengila mu Ng'anda ya Lesa, ne kubatandanyamo bonse balikulishilamo makwebo. Walawisha matebulu ngobalikulishapo, ne bipuna mbyobalikuba bekalapo pakulisha nkulimba shabo. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Uliyawa kusuminisha uliyense kupitila mu lubuwa lwa Ng'anda ya Lesa kaliwamanta kantu. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu waleyisha bantu ne kubambileti, “Sena nkacalembwa, ‘ng'anda ya kame nikakwiweti ng'anda yakupaililamo ya bantu bamishobo yonse.’ Nomba amwe mulaisandulu kuba mwakwikala bantu beshikulamuna banabo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Beshimilumbo bamakulene ne beshikwiyisha milawo ya Mose mpobalanyumfwa, balatatika kulangaula nshila ya kumushininamo Yesu, nomba balikumutina pacebo ca bantu abo balikukankamana ne njiyishilo yakendi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Mpokwalashipuluka pa muntu ngulya, Yesu ne beshikwiya bakendi balafuma mu Yelusalemu.</para>
  <para style="s">Ciyo kufuma ku citondo camukuyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:20-22">Mateyo 21:20-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Cindi ncobalikwenda mushila mpobwalaca mumenemene, balabona citondo ca mukuyu cisa calanshinganwa ne Yesu kacili cayuma conse mpaka kumiyanda. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Petulo walanuka calenshika, ne kumwambila Yesu, “Bashikwiyisha kamubonani citondo ca mukuyu ncomwashingana cilayumu”.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Nendi Yesu walabakumbuleti, “Kamushomani muli Lesa. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Cakubinga ndamwambilinga na muntu uwambila mulundu eti fuma apo mpobele, koya uliwale mu lwenje, kwamba kwakubula kutonshanya, nomba kali washometi ncalambanga ni cikenshike nditu nikenshike. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Pacebo ici, ndambilishingeti, mwapailinga ne kusenga cintu, shomani kubeti mulacitambula kendi, cili conse ncomulasengenga nimukapewe.” <verse number="25" style="v"/>“Mwatatikanga kupaila, lekelelani bonse bamwipishila kwambeti Lesa wakwilu nendi amulekeleleni bwipishi bonse.” <verse number="26" style="v"/>Na mubula kulekelela banenu, naboyo Bameshenu bakwilu nkabela kumulekelela bwipisho bwenu.</para>
  <para style="s">Balamwipushunga Yesu sha ngofu shakendi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mateyo 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luka 20:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Kayi Yesu mpwalaya ku Yelusalemu walengila mu Ng'anda ya Lesa ne kwendana mu lubuwa, beshimilumbo bamakulene, ne beshikwiyisha milawo ya Mose, ne bamakulene nabambi balesa kuli Yesu. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Balamwipusheti, “Mukute ngofu shilye coni shakwinsa cisa kwakubula kusuminishiwa? Niyani wakupa ngofu shakwinsa cisa?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu walabakumbuleti, “Ndamwipushunga mwipusho umo, na mukumbule, nenjame nindi mwambile ngondashifunya ngofu shakwinsa bintu ibi. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Inga Yohane walashifunya kupeyo ngofu shakubatisha? Kuli Lesa nambi kubantu? Kamunkumbulani.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Balakangana pa lwambo bene ne kwambeti na tukumbuleti lwalafumina kwilu ku mayoba, nendi natwipusheti, “Inga mwalabulila cani kushoma ncalikwamba?” <verse number="32" style="v"/>Nomba nkatwela kwambeti,lwafumina kubantu. Pakwinga balikutina bantu, bonse balikuba bashoma kwambeti Yohane walikuba mushinshimi. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Neco mukumbulo wabo kuli Yesu walikuba wakwambeti, “Nkatucishi?” Neco Yesu walabakumbuleti, “Nenjame nteti ndimwambile nkondalashifunya ngofu shakwinsa cisa.”</para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Mukoshanyo wabalimi balabweleka libala lya minyombela.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mateyo 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luka 20:9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Kayi Yesu walatatika kwamba kulyendibo mu mikoshanyo, walambeti, “Palikuba muntu naumbi walalima libala lya minyansa. walebaka luba kushunguluka libala, walemba cisengu cakutyaninamo minyansa ne kwibaka lupingwe. Libala ili walalibwelekesha ku balimi, nendi walaya kucishi cimbi.<figure style="fig" desc="" file="04 Winepress.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="12:1">Bantu babili balatyananga minyansa</figure> <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mpocalashika cindi ca kutebula, mwine libala walatuma musebenshi wakendi ku balimi mbwalabwelekesha, kwambeti bamupeko bisepo bya mulibala lisa. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nomba nabo balamwikata, ne kumuma ne kumutandanya, walabwelelako wabula ciliconse mu makasa. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Mwine libala walatumako kayi musebenshi wakendi naumbi. Nomba uyu balamutoba luma mu mutwi ne kumucobola cipesha nsoni. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Kayi mwine libala walatumako naumbi, uyu balamushina. Kayi walatumako nabambi nabo balabauma, kayi nabambi balashina. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Kwalashala muntu umo, mwanendi ngwalikusuna cikamba. Pakupwililisha mwine libala usa walatumako mwanendi,” Ne kwambeti, “Mwaname nibenga bamupe bulemu.” <verse number="7" style="v"/>Nomba nabo balimi balatatika kumufwiya ne kwambeti, “Uyu endiye eshakapyane buboni bwa baishi, neco katumushinani kwambeti bukabe bwetu, <verse number="8" style="v"/>Balamutanya, ne kumushina, ne kumuwala kunsa kwa luba lwa libala.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>“Inga mwine libala nakenseconi? Lakenga kubashina balimi bonse ne kubwelekesha libala lyakendi kubalimi nabambi.” <verse number="10" style="v"/>Sena nkamuna mubelengapo Mabala alambangeti,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Libwe lya candanshi ndyebalakana</para>
  <para style="q1">Beshikwibaka,</para>
  <para style="q1">Lyalaba libwe lyayandika</para>
  <para style="q1">Kupita onse.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Mwami mwine elacinshi,</para>
  <para style="q1">Kayi cakondelesha pakucibona?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Balelekesha kucana nshila ya kumwikatilamo, nomba balatina kufula kwa bantu, pakwinga balenshibeti wambangendibo mumukoshanyo, nomba balamushiya Yesu ne kuya.</para>
  <para style="s">Mwipusho wa kusonka misonko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mateyo 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luka 20:20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Bafalisi nabambi ne ba mucipani ca Helodi balatumwa kuli Yesu kwambeti bamutape mukwamba kwakendi. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Mpobalashika kuli Yesu balambeti, “Bashikwiyisha tucinshi, kwambeti mukute kwamba cakubinga, kayi nkamukute kubona cilikunsa kwa muntu, nkamukute kusakamaneti uyu niyani, nsombi mukute kwiyisha nshila ya Lesa mwancine ncine, Sena kusonka musonko ku mwami wa ku Loma casuminishiwa nambi sobwe?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>“Tusonkenga misonko nambi sobwe?” Yesu pakubenshiba bundenga mano bwabo, walabambileti, “Ingamulanjelekeshelenga cani? Kamundetelani lyali ndilibone.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Balamutambika lyali, Yesu walabepusheti, “Inga cintimbwi cilipa lyali, ne walembapo niyani?”</para>
  <para style="p">Balamukumbuleti “Ni ca Mwami waku Loma.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Neco Yesu walabambileti, “Mupeni Mwami waku Loma bintu byakendi, nendi Lesa mupeni bintu byakendi.”</para>
  <para style="p">Nomba balakankamana ne kwamba kulico.</para>
  <para style="s">Mwipusho wa pakupunduka kubafu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mateyo 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luka 20:27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Basaduki nabambi batashomo sha kupunduka kubafu balesa kuli Yesu ne kwambeti, <verse number="19" style="v"/>“Bashikwiyisha, Mose walatulembela afwe kwambeti na muntu ufwa ushiya mukashi enka wabula mwana, kanike wakendi shikufwa amwebe mukalubingi ne kusemenamo bana mu mulamu wakendi mucimo ca mukwabo <verse number="20" style="v"/>Lino palikuba batuloba basanu ne babili pabukwabo. Mukulene bantu waleba mukashi, nsombi walafwa kwa kubula kushiyapo bana, <verse number="21" style="v"/>mukwabo wamukonkapo walamweba mukalubingi, neye walafwa katana asemenamo mwana. Calenshika copeleco ku mukwabo wa butatu. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Walebwa kuli umo ne umo wa bonse basanu ne babili, nsombi bonse balafwa kwakubula kusemenamo bana, panyuma pakendi neye mukashi uyu walafwa. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Lino bantu bakapundukanga kubafu nakabe mukashi wa bani? Pakwinga bonse basanu ne babili balamwebapo?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yesu walabakumbuleti, Sena ici nteco cilapeshengeti mulubile cakwinseti mubule kwinshiba Mabala ne ngofu sha Lesa? <verse number="25" style="v"/>Pakwinga bantu beti bakapunduke kubafu nteti bakebenga nambi kwebwa, pakwinga nibakabengeti bangelo ba kwilu. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Na nimakani akwambeti sena bafwa nibakapunduke, sena muliya kubelengapo muli buku lya Mose mpalikwamba sha cifukusa calikubangila mulilo? Lesa mpwalambila Mose eti, “Ame njame Lesa wa Abulahamu, Lesa wa Isake, kayi Lesa wa Yakobo. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Nte Lesa wa bantu bafwa, nsombi wa bayumi, mwalubila kwine!”</para>
  <para style="s">Mulawo unene kupita milawo yonse.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:34-40">Mateyo 22:34-40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luka 10:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Umo wa beshikwiyisha milawo ya Mose walabanyumfwa kabakangana umo ne munendi. Kayi pakuboneti Yesu labakumbulu cakubinga ba Saduki, walamwipusha Yesu eti, “Inga nimulawo upeyo utanshi kupita yonse?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu walamukumbuleti, Mulawo utanshi ni wakwambeti, “Kamunyumfwani amwe Baislayeli, Mwami Lesa wetu, eMwami umo enka bulyo walibela. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Neco suna Mwami Lesa wakobe ne moyo wakobe wonse, ne mushimu wakobe onse, ne manjeyaulwa akobe onse, kayi ne ngofu shakobe shonse.” <verse number="31" style="v"/>Mulawo watubili ni wakwambeti, “Suna munobe mbuli ncolisuni omwine, Paliya mulawo wapita pa milawo ibili iyi sobwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Shikwiyisha Milawo ya Mose walamwambila Yesu,eti “Ncomulamba Bashikwiyisha nicakubinga, Ee pali Lesa umo enka, paliya naumbi sobwe nsombi enka bulyo. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Nomba kusuna Lesa ne moyo wakobe wonse ne buyumi bwakobe bonse ne manjeyaulwa akobe onse, kayi ne ngofu shakobe shonse, ne kusuna bantu banobe mbuli ncolisuni, kulayandikinga kupita kutwala milumbo ya banyama ne milumbo naimbi kuli Lesa.” <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu pakwinshibeti lakumbulu camano, walamwambileti, “Obe nkolipo kutali ne Bwami bwa Lesa sobwe.” Neco bonse balaba ne buyowa, neco bonse balatina bamwipusha Yesu mwipusho naumbi.</para>
  <para style="s">Mwipusho wakwamba sha Mupulushi Walaiwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mateyo 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luka 20:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalikwiyisha Mung'anda ya Lesa, walepusheti, Inga beshikwiyisha milawo ya Mose ngabambeconi eti Klistu nimwanendi Dafeti? <verse number="36" style="v"/>Kakuli Dafeti mwine pakutanguninwa ne Mushimu Uswepa, walambeti, Mwami Lesa walamba kuli mwami wakame, eti kwesa wikale ku cikasa calulyo cabulemu, mpaka nkababike balwani bakobe panshi pa myendo yakobe. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Dafeti mwine walamwambeti, “Mwami” Ngobaconi mwanendi Dafeti?</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lacenjeshenga bantu sha Beshikwiyisha ba milawo ya Mose.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mateyo 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">Luka 20:45-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">Likoto lyabantu balikumunyumfwa Yesu mwakukondwa. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalikwiyisha, walambeti, “Cetukani ne beshikwiyisha milawo ya Mose, basuna kwendana kabali muminganjo yalelemba nekuyanda kupewa mitende yabulemu mu misena ya makwebo, <verse number="39" style="v"/>bakute kuyanda kwikala pa bipuna byakuntangu mung'anda ya kupaililamo, ne mumisena ya bulemu musena yamalyalya. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Aba bantu ebakute kupwisha buboni bwa bamukalubingi, nekulibonesheti bantu balulama mumipailo yabo itali itali, aba bantu nibakatambule lombolosho lunene!”</para>
  <para style="s">Mulumbo wa mukalubingi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 21:1-4">Luka 21:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Kayi Yesu mpwalekala pepi ne kabokoshi bantu nkobalikubikamo mali mung'anda kupaililamo, walikalangishisha bantu ncobalikubikamo mali. Abo balikuba ne buboni balikubikamo mali angi, <verse number="42" style="v"/>Palashika mukalubingi mupenshi, nendi walabikamo tumali tubili twa mukuba. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Neco walakuwa beshikwiya bakendi nekubambileti, cakubinga ndamwambilinga, mukalubingi mupenshi uyu labikimo mali angi kupita ngobalabikimo bonse. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Pakwinga bonse batapulanga pa mali apitilila pa mali ngobakute kusebensesha, nsombi nendi mubupenshi bwakendi labikimo mali ngwakutenga onka mung'anda, ebwanga buyumi bwakendi.</para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu lambanga shakumwaiwa kwa Ng'anda ya Lesa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Mateyo 24:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luka 21:5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalafuma mu Ng'anda ya Lesa, umo wabeshikwiya bakendi walambeti, “Bashikwiyisha kamubonani kukonempa ne kubekema kwa mabwe ne manda awa?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Nomba nendi Yesu walamukumbuleti, “Nte ulabono manda anene anene awa onse? Paliya libwe nambi limo lyeti likashale pelu pa libwe linendi, lyeti likabule kumwaiwa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Makatasho ne mapensho</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mateyo 24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luka 21:7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalekala panshi pamulundu wamaolifi, nkabali balangana ne Ng'anda ya Lesa, Petulo ne Jemusi, ne Yohane kayi ne Ndileya balamwipusha mpobalikuba bonka nendiye kwambeti <verse number="4" style="v"/>“Kamutwambilani, inga bintu ibi nibikenshikelilyoni? Inga nicishibisho cini nceti tukaboneneko kwambeti byonsebi bilipepi kukwanilishiwa?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesu walabambileti “Cetukani, muntu uliyense katakamubepa. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Pakwinga bantu bangi nibakese lina lyakame, ne kwambeti ‘njame Klistu!’ Bantu bangi nibakabepwe. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Mwakatatika kunyumfwa sha nkondo ne mbili shankondo kamutakayakamwa sobwe. ibi byelela kwinshika, nomba ntewo mapwililisho sobwe. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Mishobo ya bantu nikabukilane, bishi nibikabukilane, Nikukabe mikunkumo mumibibela byapusana pusana, kayi nikukabe nsala. Lino byonse ibi ekutatika kwa mapensho.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>“Nomba amwe cetukani, pakwinga bantu nibakamutwale kunkuta ne kumukwapula mumanda akupaililamo.Nimukamane pamenso pa bendeleshi ba mfulumende ne bami, pacebo ca njame, kwambeti mukabe bakamboni bakame. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nomba kulayandikinga nanshi kwambeti Mulumbe Waina ukambaukwe kubantu ba mishobo yonse. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nomba bakamwikata ne kumutawala kuya komboloshewa, kamutakalibilika nekwambeti, netwambe cani, Lesa nakamupe cakwamba pacindi copeleco pakwinga shikwamba ntamwe sobwe, nsombi ni Mushimu Uswepa. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Mukwabo nakashinishe mukwabo, bamashali nibakashinishe bana babo. Nabo bana nibakabukile bamashali babo ne kubashinisha <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kayi muntu uliyense nakamupele, pacebo ca Lina lyakame, nomba uyo eti akalishishibishe mpaka kumapwililisho endiye esha akapuluke.”</para>
  <para style="s">Cintu cishikuyosha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-28">Mateyo 24:15-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luka 21:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Mwakabona cintu cishikusesemya kayi cishikononga, balacimaniki pamusena ngocabula kwelela, uyo labelengenga enshibe, abo bali mu Yudeya bafwambile ku milundu. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Uyo uli pelu pa ciluli kataseluka nekuya kwingila mung'anda yakendi kwambeti amantemo ciliconse. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Uyo muntu uli mulibala katabwelela ku munshi kuya kumanta byakufwala mbyalashiyi <verse number="17" style="v"/>Ha! Akonempa mapensho kubatukashi bakute mabunda, ne beti bakayamwishenga bana mu masubayo! <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kamupailani kwambeti kacitakaba mucindi camupewo. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Pakwinga mumasubayo bantu nibakapenge ncebatana bapengapo kufuma kucindi Lesa ncalalenga cishi mpaka kushika cindi cino, kayi nteti bakapengepo cilico sobwe. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Lesa nalabula kwafumfwipishilalimo masubayo, nshinga ne palakabulu muntu naba umo shikupuluka, nomba pacebo ca bantu basalwa bakendi, masubayo walafumfwipishilalimo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Nomba pacindi copeleco, na muntu akamwambileti, “Kamubonani Klistu ulikuno, Nambi wambeti, ‘Klistu uli uko!’ Kamutakashoma. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Pakwinga nikukaboneke ba klistu bangi bandemi shibili ne bashinshimi bandemi shibili. Nibakensenga bingashilo ne bintu bishikukankamanisha, ne kubepa uliyense kayi na kacikonsheka, nabo basalwa, bashome bwepeshi. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Neco amwe cetukani! Ndamwambilili limo bintu byeti bikenshike.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kwisa kwa Mwana Muntu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mateyo 24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luka 21:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Mumasubayo, cindi camapensho cakapita lisuba nilikasanduke mushinshe ne mwenshi nukaleke kubala. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Nyenyenshi nishikatatike kulaka kufuma kwilu, ne ngofu sha bwendeleshi bwa mwilu nibukatenkane <verse number="26" style="v"/>Lino, bantu nibakamubone Mwana Muntu kesa mumakumbi ne ngofu shinene ne bulemeneno. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Pacindico Yesu nakatume bangelo bakendi kuya kubunganya bantu basalwa mumbasu shonse, kufumina kwakuma cinshi ne kuya kwakuma cishi.</para>
  <para style="s">Lwiyo pa citondo ca mukuyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mateyo 24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luka 21:29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Kamwiyakoni mukoshanyo kucitondo camukuyu. Misampi yatatika kusonsa matewu mukute kwinshibeti mainsa alipepi. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Nenjamwe mwakabona bintu ibi kabinshika nimukenshibeti Mwana Muntu ulipepi, uli pacishinga. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Cakubinga ndamwambilishingeti uwu musemano nteti ukapite sobwe mpaka ibi bintu bikenshike. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Kwilu ne cishi capanshi nibikapite, nsombi ciyisho cakame nteti cikapite sobwe.</para>
  <para style="s">Paliya ubwinshi busuba nambi cindi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:36-44">Mateyo 24:36-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>“Nomba kwamba sha cindi nambi busuba, paliya naba umo ubwinshi, nambi bangelo ba kwilu nkabacinshi, nambi mwana nkabwinshi nsombi Bata bonka.” <verse number="33" style="v"/>Cetukani, pembelelani, pakwinga nkamucishi na nililyoni cindi ncoti cikashike. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Ici cili mbuli cikutekwinshika muntu aya pabulwendo, ukute ushiya mukowa nekupa ngofu basebenseshi bakendi, uliyense incito yakendi. Ne kumukonkomesha mulonda kwambeti katashinshilanga. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Nenjamwe cetukani, pakwinga nkamucishi cindi ncoti akese mwine ng'anda, mpani ni mansailo, mpani ni paka pa mashiku, mpani pacindi ca malililo abakombwe mpani nimumenemene, <verse number="36" style="v"/>kwambeti mwine ng'anda esa mwakutengashila, katesamucane kamuli monatulo. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Neco ncondamwambilinga amwe ndambilinga bonse. Weco cetukani.</para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Balalangaulunga mwakumwikatila Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mateyo 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luka 22:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yohane 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Mpokwalashala masuba abili kwambeti kube Pasika, ne kusekelela kwa shinkwa wabula chishikufufumusha. Beshimilumbo bamakulene ne beshikwiyisha Milawo ya Mose, bali kulangaula mwakumwikatila Yesu kwakubula kwinshiba bantu kwambeti bamushine. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Nomba balikwambeti “Nkatwelela kumwikata pa cindi cakusekelela sobwe, pakwinga ngapaba mipyopyongano.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lalanikiwanga mafuta ku Betani.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Mateyo 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yohane 12:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalikuba mung'anda ya shimoni, shimankuntu ku Betani, pacindi ncebalikulya kwalashika mutukashi walikuba wamata nsupa yalibwe lya alabasita mwalikuba wabika mafuta anunkila amulo wadula, amushobo wa nadi. Walapwaya nsupa ya libwe ne kutatika kwitila mafuta pa mutwi wa Yesu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nomba nabambi calabepila, balambeti “Nipacebo cini ncalatayilinga awa mafuta anunkila cisa?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>“Canga celela kwaulisha mafutawa ne kucanamo mali angi ngelakufola muntu pa caka, akunyamfwilisha bakandu.” Neco balamukalalila mutukashi usa. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nomba Yesu walambeti, “Mulekeni, mulamupenshelenga cani uyu mutukashi? Ici ncalenshili ame caina. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Pakwinga bakandu mulinabo cindi conse, cakwinseti mwayandanga kubenshila byaina, inga mubenshila, nomba amwe nteti mubenga nenjame cindi conse sobwe. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Uyu mutukashi lenshi ncelela kwinsa, pakwinga lananikili limo mafuta pamubili wakame kantanambikwa mu manda. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Cakubinga ndambangeti kulikonse uko Mulumbe Waina nkoti ukakambaukwe pa cishi conse. Ici ncalenshi mutukashi uyu naco nibakacambenga kubantu kwambeti bakamwanukilengaponga.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yuda lasumininga kumulisha Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mateyo 26:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luka 22:3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nomba Yuda Sikalyote umo wa beshikwiya likumi ne babili, walaya kuli beshimilumbo bamakulene kuya kumulisha kulyendibo. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Balakondwa mpobalanyumfwa ncalabambila ne kumushomesha kwambeti nibakamupe mali ngobalapangana. Nendi walatatika kulangaula cindi celela ca kumulisha.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lalinga Pasika ne beshikwiya bakendi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Mateyo 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-14">Luka 22:7-14</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yohane 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Pabusuba bwakutanguna bwa kusekelela kwa shinkwa wabula cishikufufumusha, pacindi ncobali kubenga milumbo ya nyama, beshikwiya bakendi Yesu balamwipusheti, “Inga mulayandanga twengakupeyo kuya kumubambila musena wakulyelako Pasika.?” <verse number="13" style="v"/>Popelapo Yesu walatuma beshikwiya babili kuya kulangaula musena, ne kubambileti, “Kamuyani mu munshi uwu. Nimukumane ne mutuloba wamanta mungomo wa menshi mumukonkele. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Engila mung'anda mumwambile mwine, eti ‘Bashikwiyisha balepushungeti, cilikupeyo cipinda cabensu umo mweti njise ndyele Pasika pamo ne beshikwiya bakame? <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nomba amulesha ng'anda yapelu mwabambwa cena, mopelomo mweshimubambile Pasika.” <verse number="16" style="v"/>Neco beshikwiya basa balaya mumunshi, kayi byalenshika ndendende mbuli mwalabambilila, Pasika balamubambila kopeloko. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Cakumansailo Yesu pamo ne beshikwiya likumi ne babili balashika. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Pacindi ncobalekala panshi kabalya Yesu walabambileti, “Cakubinga ndamwambilinga umo pali njamwe uyo lalinga pamo nenjame nangulishe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Bonse balanyumfwa nsoni ne kutatika ku mwipusha Yesu umo ne umo kabambeti, “Ndashometi ntame ngomulambanga ayi?” <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nendi Yesu walambeti, “Umo pali amwe likumi ne babili, ‘Umo pali njamwe, uyo walyanga pamo nenjame mumbale iyi, epeloyo elangulishinga.’ <verse number="21" style="v"/>Ni cakubinga Mwana Muntu lenga akufwa, mbuli Mabala ncalambanga sha endiye, nomba malele ku muntu lamulishinga Mwana wa Muntu! Ne calaba cena muntuyo nalabula kusemwa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Sha cakulya ca mansailo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luka 22:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Bakolinto 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Mpobalikulya Yesu walamanta shinkwa ne kulumba Lesa, ne kukomauna shinkwa ne kubapa, ne kwambeti, “Kamumanta shinkwa uwu, emubili wakame.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Kayi walamanta nkomenshi mwalikuba waini walalumba Lesa, panyuma pakendi walabatambika nkomeshi mpaka bonse balanwamo. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Panyuma pakendi walabambileti, “Waini uwu emilopa yakame ya Cipangano iletikilinga bantu bangi. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Cakubinga ndamwambilingeti, nteti nkanwepo waini mpaka pa busuba ubo mbweshi nkanwe waini naumbi mu Bwami bwa Lesa.” <verse number="26" style="v"/>Mpobalapwisha kwimbila nyimbo shakushikaisha Lesa balapula ne kuya ku mulundu maolifi.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lacenjeshenga Petulo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mateyo 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luka 22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yohane 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yesu walabambileti, “Mwense nimunkane mbuli Mabala alambangeti, ‘Ninkashine mwembeshi, ne mbelele ni shikamwaike.’ <verse number="28" style="v"/>Ndakapundushiwa kufuma kubafu, ninkamutangunine kuya ku Galileya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Petulo nendi walambeti kuli Yesu, “Nambi bonse bamukane ame nkandelela.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yesu popelapo walamwambileti, “Cakubinga ndakwambilinga obe Petulo Kombwe katanalila tunkanda tubili lelo mashiku, obe nunkane tunkanda tutatu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Nsombi nendi Petulo walakumbula cangofu, “Nkandelela kwambeco, nambi eti mfwa pamo nenjamwe!” Beshikwiya nabambi bonse balamba cimocimo.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ku Getsemane</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mateyo 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luka 22:39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Mpolabashika pa musena walikukwiweti Getsemane Yesu walabambila beshikwiya bakendi, “Kamwikalako panshi pamo ndenga kuya kupaila kuli Lesa.” <verse number="33" style="v"/>Pakuya uko walamanta Petulo ne Jemusi kayi ne Yohane, nsombi walapenga ne kuyakamwa mumoyo. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Neco walabambileti, “Ame ndetelwa mumoyo cakwinsa kufwa, kamwikalani pano, kamutashinshila.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Mpwalendako ntamwa shingana Yesu walaliwisha panshi nekutatika kupaileti, nakacikonsheka cintu cilayandanga kwinshika pacindi ici, cibule kwishinka. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Kayi walambeti, “Abba, Ta, Amwe ngamwinsa bintu bili byonse, kamufunyani nkomeshi mapensho ilayandanga kwisa pali njame, nsombi kakutaba kuyanda kwakame, sobwe nsombi kube kuyanda kwenu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Mpwalabwela pamusena mpwalabashiya walacana kabali bonatulo, neco walepusha Petulo, “Shimoni sena ucili wonatulo, ‘nkowelela kuliyumishako kwakacindi kang'anowa?” <verse number="38" style="v"/>Kayi walabambileti, “Mobantu amwe pundukani, mupaile kwambeti kamutengila mumapensho, cakubinga, moyo ulandishishinga, nomba mubili walefuka.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yesu walabashiya kayi beshikwiya batatu basa, walaya akupaila kayi kamba cimo cimo. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Mpwalabwela walacana nkabali bonatulo pakwinga bikope byabo byalikuba byalema, neco balabula cakwamba kulyendiye. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Walabwela kacitatu ne kubepusheti “Mucili monatulo ne kupumwina? Mwaliba! Cindi cilakwana kamubonani Mwana Muntu ulipepi kutwalwa mu makasa abantu baipa. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Nyamukani, tiyeni. Kamubonani shikungulisha nte uyu lashiki.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kwikatwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mateyo 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luka 22:47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Yohane 18:3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>Yesu kacamba maswi awa Yuda Isikalyoti umo wabeshikwiya likumi ne babili walashika pamo ne likoto lyabantu abo balatumwa ne beshimilumbo bamakulene, ne beshikwiyisha milawo ya Mose ne bamakulene, kabalibamanta byensho, ne mingwala. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Apa shikumulisha Yesu wali kalilabapakendi cishibisho ncobalayumfwana pamo cakwambeti, “Uyo ngotinshonshote pakumupa mitende, endiye Yesu mumwikatishe, mwenganendi, kamutamulekapo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Yuda walaya pali kuba Yesu mwakufwambana ne kwambeti, “Mitende Bashikwiyisha,” Ne kumunshonshonta. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Neco balamutanya Yesu ne kumusunga. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Nomba naumo walikuba wemana pepi walasolola cibeshi cakendi ne kukwempula naco litwi lya musebenshi wa Shimilumbo Mukulene. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Nendi Yesu walabepusheti, “Inga mulamantili cani bibeshi, ne mingwala pakwisa kunjikata eti mulesanga kulwana ne kapondo? <verse number="49" style="v"/>Masuba onse ndalikuba nenu mpondali kwiyisha mu Ng'anda ya Lesa, muliyawa kuyeya shakunjikata. Nomba ibi bilenshikinga kwambeti Mabala akwanilishiwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Beshikwiya bonse balafwamba ne kumushiya enka.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>Nomba mutuloba naumo walikuba walifweka mwingila walikakonkela Yesu. Neye balayanda kumwikata, <verse number="52" style="v"/>Walashiya cakufwala cakendi mumakasa abo ne kufwamba matakosha.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lomboloshewanga ne Bamakulene Baciyuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-68">Mateyo 26:57-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luka 22:54-55</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Yohane 18:13-14</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>Balamutwala Yesu kuli Shimilumbo mukulene uko nkobalabungana beshimilumbo bonse, ne beshikwiyisha ya milawo ne bamakulene bonse. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Nomba Petulo walikuba pamo ne bantu bangi abo balikukonkela panyuma, mpaka walakengila mukati mwalubuwa lwa ng'anda ya Shimilumbo Mukulene, walakekala panshi pamo ne bamalonda kayota mulilo. <verse number="55" style="v"/>Pacindici beshimilumbo bamakulene, pamo ne Nkuta inene ya Bayuda, bali kulangaula bukamboni bwakwambeti Yesu acanike ne mulandu wakumushina, nomba calala kubacana. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Pakwinga bangi balamba bukamboni bwapusanapusana pakuyanda kumucaninapo mulandu Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>Nikukabeco nabambi bali kwimana ne kwamba bukamboni bwabwepeshi, <verse number="58" style="v"/>ne kwambeti, “Afwe twalamunyumfwa kambeti, ‘Ame ninkaiwishe Ng'anda ya Lesa iyi yalebakwa ne makasa,’ Nomba mu masuba atatu ame ninkebake imbi itebakwa ne makasa.” <verse number="59" style="v"/>Nikukabeco byonse mbyobalikwamba nkabyalikuba byekatana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v"/>Shimilumbo mukulene walemana ne kumwipusha Yesu, “Sena uliyawa cakwambapo? Sena nibyakubinga ibi mbyobala kwambanga?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v"/>Nomba nendi walamwena tonto, uliya kwambapo ciliconse. Apa kayi Shimilumbo Mukulene walamwipusha Yesu, “Sena njobe Klistu, Mwanendi Lesa Walelekwa?” <verse number="62" style="v"/>Yesu walakumbuleti, “Cakubinga ame njame. Mobantu amwe nimukabone Mwana Muntu kaliwekala kucikasa ca lulyo ca ngofu, nimukamubone kesa mumakumbi akwilu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v"/>Shimilumbo mukulene mpwalanyumfwa maswi awa walatwamuna mwinjila wakendi nekwambeti, “Sena muciyanda kayi bakamboni nabambi? <verse number="64" style="v"/>Mulalinyumfwili mobene ncalamunyansa Lesa. Mulayeyengapongeconi?” Bonse balambeti lacaniki ne mulandu, welela kufwa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v"/>Popelapo nabambi balatatika kumusankila mata, kumufweka pamenso, ne kumuma makofi, ne kwambeti, “Lotela!” Inga niyani lakumu? Panyuma pakendi, bamalonda balamumanta kabaya kumuma.</para>
  <para style="s">Petulo lamukananga Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">Mateyo 26:69-75</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luka 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yohane 18:15-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v"/>Petulo kacili mu lubuwa lwamukati, umo musebenshi mutukashi wa Shimilumbo Mukulene walesa. <verse number="67" style="v"/>Mpwalamubona Petulo kayota mulilo walamulangishisha nekwambeti, “Nenjamwe mwalikuba ne Yesu waku Nasaleti.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v"/>Nsombi nendi walamukana nekwambeti, “Nambi kumwinshiba, nkandi mwinshipo, kayi nkandanyumfwishishinga na ulambanga cani.” Mpwalambeco walapula kaya pacishinga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v"/>Kayi musebenshi mutukashi usa mpwalamubona kayi, walatatika kubambila abo mbwalikuba nabo pepi kwambeti, “Muntuyu walikwenda ne Yesu.” <verse number="70" style="v"/>Kayi apa walamukana.</para>
  <para style="p">Mpopalapita kacindi pang'ana abo balikuba bemana pepi nendi Petulo balatatika kumwipusha eti, “Cakubinga obe njobe umo wa endibo nenjobe omu Galileya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v"/>Nsombi nendi walatatika kulishinganya, ne kulumbileti, “Ame nkandimwishi muntuyu ngomulambanga sobwe.” Ne Kombwe walalila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v"/>Popelapo kayi Kombwe walalila katubili, Petulo walanuka ncalamwambila Yesu “Cakubinga ndakwabilinga Petulo obe, kombwe katanalila tunkanda tubili mashiku alelo obe nunkane tunkanda tutatu.” Neco,walatatika kulila cakutamwena.</para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu uli kuli Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mateyo 27:1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luka 23:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yohane 18:28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Mpobwalaca mumene beshimilumbo bamakulene, ne bamakulene ne beshikwiyisha milawo ya Mose ne Nkuta inene yaba Yuda bonse balabungana mwabwangu bwangu, balamusunga Yesu ne kuya nendi kuli Pilato. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Pilato walepusha “Sena njobe Mwami waba Bayuda?” Yesu walakumbuleti, “Ee, encomulamba” <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nomba beshimilumbo bamakulene balamubepesha bintu bingi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kayi Pilato walepusha Yesu, “Sena paliya ncowela kukumbulapo? Bona kufula milandu njobalakubeshenga” <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nomba Yesu uliya kumukumbulapo, neco Pilato walakankamana.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lapewa mulandu wa kufwa.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mateyo 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luka 23:13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Yohane 18:39—19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Cindi conse pa kusekelela Pasika, Pilato walikukute cinga ca kupulisha mujele kaili umo uyo bantu ngobalamusenge. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Pacindici kwalikuba muntu walikukwiweti Balaba walasungwa mujele pamo ne nabambi balashina muntu pakulwanisha mfulumende. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Neco likoto lya bantu lyalesa kuli Pilato ne kumusenga kwambeti ainsepo cimo kwelana ne cinga ncakute kwinsa. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Pilato walabakumbuleti, “Mulayandanga ndimusungulwile Mwami wa Bayuda?” <verse number="10" style="v"/>Pakwinga Pilato walaboneshesha kwambeti nipacebo caminyono yabo ecalapesheti beshimilumbo bamakulene bamulete Yesu kulyendiye. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nomba beshimilumbo bamakulene balayungaula bantu kwambeti basenge Pilato abasungulwile Balaba. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nendi Pilato kayi walabepusheti, “Inga ndimwinseconi uyu ngomulambangeti eMwami wa Bayuda?” <verse number="13" style="v"/>Balo balabilikisheti “Apopwe!” <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nomba kayi Pilato walapitilisha kubepusheti, “Inga nipacebo cini? Inga lenshi mulandu cini,” Nomba nabo empobalolobesheti, “Apopwe?” <verse number="15" style="v"/>Pilato pakuyanda kubakondwelesha, walabasungulwila Balaba, ne kwambeti Yesu bamukwapule, kayi bamutwale kuya kumupopa.</para>
  <para style="s">Bashilikali balamutakaushunga Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:27-31">Mateyo 27:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Yohane 19:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Bashilikali balamumanta Yesu kuya nendi mukati mulubuwa lwa ng'anda ya mwendeleshi, ne kubunganya bashilikali bonse. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Balamufwalika Yesu mwinjila ufubeluka, balapomba cishoti cabwami ca myunga ne kumufwalika. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Balatatika kumupa mitende mwalisongwe kabambeti, “Mwikale ne buyumi butali amwe Mwami wa Bayuda!” <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kayi balabamuma pamutwi neluntele nekumusankila mata ne kumusuntamina kabamukambilila. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Mpobalapwisha kumutakausha, balamufulula mwinjila ufubeluka ne kumufwalika mwinjila wakendi, balamutangunya kuya kumupopa.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lapopwanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mateyo 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luka 23:26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yohane 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kayi mpobalikuya balakumanya Shimoni, waku Kulene walikupita kafuma kumunshi, baishi Alekisandulo ne Lufu, balamukakatisha kwambeti amante lusanda lwa Yesu. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Balashika nendi pa musena walikukwiweti, Gologota, ekwambeti musena wacifupa ca mutwi. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Balamupa waini wasankanishiwa ne mule, nomba nendi Yesu walakana kunwa. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Panyuma pakumupopa, balauma nsolo kwambeti babone umo ne umo ngaumantapo cani pa byakufwala byakendi. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yesu balamupopa pa lusanda ne cindi ca 9 koloko mumenemene. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Malembo alambanga sha mulandu ngobalamupa alikubelengweti, “Mwami wa Bayuda.” <verse number="27" style="v"/>Kayi kopeloko kwalikuba kwapopwa kapondo babili umo kucikasa cakululyo ca Yesu, naumbi kucikasa ca kucipiko ca Yesu. <verse number="28" style="v"/><note caller="+" style="f"/>Mabala alakwanilishiwa akwambeti,walabelengelwa pamo ne bamilandu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Bantu balikupita pepi balikwamba maswi akumutukana Yesu kabapukumuna mitwi yabo kabambeti, “Ba! Obe shikuwisha Ng'anda ya Lesa, kayi ne kuyibaka mumasuba atatu, <verse number="30" style="v"/>kolipulusha wenka, selukapo palusandapo!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Nabo beshimilumbo ba makulene, pamo ne beshikwiyisha milawo ya Mose balikumuwela Yesu, nekwamba palwabo beneti, “Walikupulusha bantu bambi,nkela kulipulusha mwine. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Klistu Mwami wa Baislayeli lino koselukapo pa lusanda, kwambeti afwe tubone kayi tushome” Nabo balikuba bapopwa pamo ne Yesu balikumutukana.</para>
  <para style="s">Kufwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mateyo 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luka 23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yohane 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Cindi mpocalashika muma 12 koloko munshi, mucishico mwalaba mushinshe mpaka cindi ca 3 koloko mansailo. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Pacindi ca muma 3 koloko Yesu walabilikisha ne liswi lyangofu “Eloi Eloi Lama sabakatani!” Uku ekwambeti, “Lesa wakame, Lesa wakame, mulanshiyi aconi ndenka!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Abo balikubapo mpobalanyumfwa ncalikwamba balambeti “Kamubonani! Lakunga Eliya.” <verse number="36" style="v"/>Popelapo naumbi walamanta cisambo nekufwamba kuya kucisabika mu waini wasasa, ne kucisungilila ku lutele nekumupa kwambeti anwe, kambeti, “Katupembelelani, tubone na Eliya nese amuselushe palusanda.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Pacindici Yesu walakuluma cangofu ne kutaya moyo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Naco cikwisa ca mu Ng'anda ya Lesa, calikucala pakati pa cipinda Caswepa ne cipinda Caswepeshesha calatwamuka pakati kutatikila pelu mpaka panshi. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Lino mushilikali mukulene walikuba wemane pepi kali walangana ne Yesu, mpwalabona kwambeti Yesu lataya moyo, walambeti, “Cakubinga muntuyu wanga mwanendi Lesa!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Palikuba kayi batukashi balikuba bemana capataliko kabebelela, pakati pabo palikuba Maliya waku magadala ne Maliya banyina Jemusi kanike wakonka Yose, kayi ne Salome, <verse number="41" style="v"/>abo ebalikwenda pamo nendiye nekumusebensela cindi ncalikuba ku Galileya.Palikuba kayi batukashi bangi balesa pamo nendiye ku Yelusalemu.</para>
  <para style="s">Kubikwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mateyo 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luka 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yohane 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Cindi camansailo pabusuba bwakulibambila kwambeti lilo bwakaca nibusuba bwa Sabata, <verse number="43" style="v"/>Yosefe waku Alimateya umo wa mu Nkuta inene ya Bayuda weshibikwa ne bonse, uyo neye walikupembelela Bwami bwa Lesa, walayumisha moyo nekuya kusenga mubili wa Yesu kuli Pilato. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Nomba Pilato walakankamana kunyumfweti Yesu lafu kendi.Walakuwa mushilikali mukulene, nekumwipusha kwambeti ashininkishe na nicakubinga Yesu lafu kendi <verse number="45" style="v"/>Mpwalamwambila Pilato kwambeti nicakubinga Yesu lafu kendi, walamusuminisha Yosefe kumanta mubili wa Yesu. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Yosefe walaula cikwisa, mpwalaselusha mubili panshi, walaufungaila mu cikwisa, walamanta mubili nekuya kubika mumanda abeswa mulibwe, ne kukunkulushilapo cilibwe pa cishinga ca manda. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Maliya Magadala, ne Maliya banyina Yose, balikabebelela ne kubonapo mpwalabikwa.</para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kupunduka kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Mateyo 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luka 24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yohane 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Mpobwalapita busuba bwa Sabata, Maliya waku Magadala ne Salome ne Maliya banyina Jemusi, balaula mafuta anunkila kwambeti benga bamunanike. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mpobwalaca mumenemene pasondo balaya kumanda lisuba kalili lilapulu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>pakuya balikwipushaneti, “Inga niyani eshi engatukunkulushileko cilibwe cisa kucifunya pa cishinga ca manda?” <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nomba mpobalalangishisha cena, balabona cilibwe cisa kacili cakunkulushiwa pambali, calikuba cilibwe cinene. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nomba mpobalengila mumanda, balabona mutuloba kali wekala panshi kucikasa cakululyo, kaliwa wafwala mwinjila utuba, neco balakankamana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nomba nendi walabambileti, “Kamutakankamana, ndicinsheti mulalangaulunga Yesu waku Nasaleti usa wanga wapopwa palusanda, Lapunduku kubafu, nkalimo sobwe, kamwisani mulibonene mobene mukati muno mobanga bamubika. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Lino kamuyani mwambile beshikwiya bakendi ne Petulo kwambeti, nendi latangunu kendi kuya ku Galileya nkweshi mwenga mumubone mbuli ncalamwambila.” <verse number="8" style="v"/>Balapula mumanda ne kufwamba kufumako ku manda kabatutuma,ne kukankamana, neco paliya muntu ngobalambilako, pakwinga balekatwa ne buyowa.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu labonekelenga kuli Maliya Magadala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Mateyo 28:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:11-18">Yohane 20:11-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>
    <note caller="+" style="f"/>Lino Yesu mpwalapunduka pasondo mumenemene, walabonekela nanshi kuli Maliya Magadala usa ngwalapulishamo mishimu yaipa isanu ne ibili. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Mutukashuyu walaya kwambila abo mbwali kuba nabo Yesu, pakwinga balikuba baungumana kabalila. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nomba mpobalanyumfweti nimuyumi, kayi labonekele kulyendiye, balakana kushoma sobwe. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Panyuma pakendi walabonekela kubantu babili mucinso cimbi, mpobalikwenda kabaya kumunshi. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Aba bantu balabwelela kuya kwambila beshikwiya, nomba naboyo baliya kubashoma sobwe.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu labonekelenga kuli beshikwiya likumi ne umo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mateyo 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luka 24:36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yohane 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Incito 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Panyuma pakendi kayi walabonekela kuli beshikwiya likumi ne umo pacindi ncobalikulya cakulya patebulu, nomba walabakalalila pacebo ca kubula lushomo, pakwinga myoyo yabo yalikuba yayuma, baliya kushoma mpobalambilwa ne bantu balamubona mpwalapundushiwa kubafu. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nomba nendi walabambileti, “Kamuyani mukambauke Mulumbe Waina mu cishi conse, ku mishobo yonse ya bantu. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Abo betibashomenga ne kubatishiwa beti bakapuluke, nomba beti bakabule kushoma beti bakacanike ne mulandu. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Abo bashoma nibakaleshenga bingashilo ibi, mulina lyakame nibakapulishenga mishimu yaipa, nibakambenga mumilaka yensu. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nibakamantenga njoka mumakasa, nambi banwa cintu ciliconse cikute mutondo nteti bakakolewe sobwe, nibakabikenga makasa pa balwashi, nabo nibakabe cena.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lamantwanga kuya kwilu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Luka 24:50-53</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Incito 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>(Neco Mwami Yesu mpwalapwisha kwamba nabo, walamantwa kuya kwilu, ne kuya kwikala kucikasa cakululyo ca Lesa. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Lino balaya kukambauka kulikonse, Mwami walikusebensa nabo, kushininkisheti kukambauka kwabo kwalikuba kwa ncinencine kupitila mu bingashilo byalikwinshika.)</para>
</usx>
